#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "I wonder if it will come back?"
msgstr "Me pregunto si volverá a crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
msgid "That's really burning!"
msgstr "¡Está ardiendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a clump of reeds."
msgstr "Es una mata de juncos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED"
msgid "All the useful reeds have already been picked."
msgstr "Ya se llevaron todas las cañas útiles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST"
msgid "Keep off, evil sun!"
msgstr "¡Mantente alejado, sol del demonio!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RELIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RELIC"
msgid "Ancient household goods."
msgstr "Antiguos artículos para el hogar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT"
msgid "It won't be doing much science now."
msgstr "Ahora ya no va a hacer mucha ciencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC"
msgid "It breaks down objects into their scientific components."
msgstr "Descompone objetos en sus componentes científicos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT"
msgid "The extra science didn't keep it alive."
msgstr "La ciencia adicional no lo mantuvo con vida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC"
msgid "It's even more science-y than the last one!"
msgstr "¡Es aún más científico que el anterior!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT"
msgid "Whatever it was, it's burnt now."
msgstr "Fuera lo que fuese, ahora está quemado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC"
msgid "What have I created?"
msgstr "¿Qué fue lo que creé?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT"
msgid "Fire doesn't really solve naming issues..."
msgstr "El fuego no resuelve la cuestión del nombre..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC"
msgid "Who would name something that?"
msgstr "¿Quién le pondría ese nombre?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL"
msgid "I like the dust! It feels scholarly!"
msgstr "¡A mí me gusta el polvo! ¡Me hace sentir intelectual!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT"
msgid "Not much use anymore."
msgstr "Ya no sirve de mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a handsome devil!"
msgstr "¡Qué demonio tan atractivo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE"
msgid "It's always a good idea to touch base."
msgstr "Siempre es bueno ponerse en contacto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REVIVER"
msgid "The beating of this hideous heart will bring a ghost back to life!"
msgstr "¡El latido de este corazón horrible traerá a un fantasma a la vida!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL"
msgid "He's got a nose for this kind of work."
msgstr "Tiene un olfato especial para este tipo de trabajo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY"
msgid "I see a big juicy drumstick with my name on it."
msgstr "Ese enorme y jugoso muslo tiene mi nombre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Does that mean winter is gone?"
msgstr "¿Significa eso que el invierno se terminó?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD"
msgid "He likes my pocket."
msgstr "Le gusta mi bolsillo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Life in the frozen wastes."
msgstr "La vida en las tierras heladas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD"
msgid "It's so soft."
msgstr "Es tan suave."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
msgid "They're trapped!"
msgstr "¡Está atrapado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK"
msgid "It wouldn't fit in my pocket."
msgstr "No cabría en mi bolsillo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCKS"
msgid "We could make stuff with these."
msgstr "Podríamos hacer cosas con ellas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCKY"
msgid "It has terrifying claws."
msgstr "Tiene unas garras terroríficas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN"
msgid "Its fruit growing days are over."
msgstr "Sus días de producción de frutas se acabaron."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "It's burning!"
msgstr "¡Se está quemando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks pretty sick."
msgstr "Parece bastante enfermo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "Err, something's not right."
msgstr "Eh, algo anda mal aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a bush... from the moon!"
msgstr "Es un arbusto... ¡de la luna!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "It'll take awhile to grow more fruit."
msgstr "Le tomará un tiempo producir más fruta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "It's pretty hot out."
msgstr "Está haciendo bastante calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT"
msgid "I'd shatter my teeth on that."
msgstr "Me voy a romper un diente si la muerdo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE"
msgid "Uncooked stone fruit is the pits."
msgstr "Esta fruta rocosa sin cocinar es de lo peor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED"
msgid "It's actually soft enough to eat now."
msgstr "Ahora sí está lo bastante suave para comerla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT"
msgid "It's growing."
msgstr "Está creciendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
msgid "Ice to meet you."
msgstr "Congelado de conocerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED"
msgid "Won't be useful until it freezes again."
msgstr "No será útil hasta que se congele de nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED"
msgid "Won't be useful until it freezes again."
msgstr "No será útil hasta que se congele de nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "A crusted over lava pit."
msgstr "Un pozo de lava dura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
msgid "The lava's crusting over."
msgstr "La lava se está secando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "Agradable y confortable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT"
msgid "Looks fragile."
msgstr "Parece frágil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON"
msgid "That rock came from the moon."
msgstr "Esa roca proviene de la luna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "It looks scared stiff."
msgstr "Parece tieso de miedo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "It looks scared stiff."
msgstr "Parece tieso de miedo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "Storm the castle!"
msgstr "¡Asalta el castillo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Terrifying!"
msgstr "¡Aterrador!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "Some short lengths of rope."
msgstr "Algunos tramos cortos de cuerda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG"
msgid "Ew! It stinks!"
msgstr "¡Puaj! ¡Apesta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "It infuses the eater with the power of science!"
msgstr "¡Otorga el poder de la ciencia si la comes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "Just bits and pieces of rock."
msgstr "Solo son fragmentos de roca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "How's my hair?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal tengo el pelo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "It has quite a heft to it."
msgstr "Pesa bastante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "This can be fixed."
msgstr "Esto se puede arreglar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "I hear whispers. It wants something."
msgstr "Oigo susurros. Quiere algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "It's passing its judgment."
msgstr "Emite su juicio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "This could take a saddle off."
msgstr "Esto podría quitar una silla de montar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "That'll allow the mounting of some smelly animal."
msgstr "Con esto se podrá montar a algún animal maloliente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "This saddle really flies!"
msgstr "¡Esta silla vuela!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "The only problem is the saddle sores."
msgstr "El único problema es que luego te duele todo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALSA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALSA"
msgid "So... hot...!"
msgstr "¡Qué... picante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX"
msgid "Just the cure for spoiling food!"
msgstr "¡La solución para que la comida no se eche a perder!"

