#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC"
