#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE"
msgid "Apparently there's no actual rats in it."
msgstr "Al parecer, no está hecho con ratas de verdad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RAZOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RAZOR"
msgid "I found a whisker on my chin, I'm sure my beard will come in any day now."
msgstr "Me salió un pelo en la barbilla. Estoy seguro de que mi barba ya viene en camino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REDGEM"
msgid "I think this gem might be magic."
msgstr "Me parece que esta gema podría ser mágica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN"
msgid "I like this dramatic lighting!"
msgstr "¡Me encanta esta iluminación dramática!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE"
msgid "This eye looks bloodshot!"
msgstr "¡Este ojo se ve inyectado de sangre!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH"
msgid "It's jingling."
msgstr "Está tintineando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP"
msgid "That definitely looks poisonous."
msgstr "Eso definitivamente parece venenoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Did cooking it make it less poisonous?"
msgstr "¿Cocinarlo le quitó un poco el veneno?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Probably shouldn't pick that one."
msgstr "Es probable que no deba recoger ese."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "There's a mushroom hiding down there."
msgstr "Hay un champiñón escondido ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Maybe it will grow back?"
msgstr "Tal vez vuelva a crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
msgid "Uh oh, who wasn't practicing fire safety?"
msgstr "Oh, oh. ¿Quién no siguió las medidas de protección contra incendios?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC"
msgid "A pretty normal thing to see in a swamp."
msgstr "Es muy normal hallarlos en los pantanos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED"
msgid "Nothing left to gather here."
msgstr "No queda nada que recoger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST"
msgid "Do I look as cool as I feel?"
msgstr "¿Me veo tan genial como creo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RELIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RELIC"
msgid "It's even older than the furniture at my grandpa's house."
msgstr "Es incluso más vieja que los muebles de la casa de mi abuelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT"
msgid "Did that look like a campfire?!"
msgstr "¡¿Acaso les parecía que eso era una fogata?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC"
msgid "I never knew science was such an important part of survival."
msgstr "No sabía que la ciencia cumplía un rol tan importante en la supervivencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT"
msgid "I wish things would stop catching fire."
msgstr "Ojalá las cosas dejaran de incendiarse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC"
msgid "They never taught us about alchemy in school."
msgstr "Nunca nos enseñaron alquimia en la escuela."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT"
msgid "I guess the magic wasn't fireproof."
msgstr "Creo que la magia también es combustible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC"
msgid "Is it really magic?"
msgstr "¿Es magia de verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT"
msgid "I guess that's one way of putting an end to the mystery."
msgstr "Supongo que esa es una forma de resolver el misterio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't really understand how it's supposed to work."
msgstr "No entiendo muy bien cómo funciona esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL"
msgid "It changes how things look, but they're still the same deep down."
msgstr "Cambia el aspecto de las cosas, pero siguen siendo iguales por dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of supplies..."
msgstr "Qué desperdicio de suministros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC"
msgid "I thought bringing back the dead involved more levers and electricity."
msgstr "Creí que resucitar a los muertos implicaba más electricidad y palancas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE"
msgid "It must've been used by an ancient civilization!"
msgstr "¡Una civilización antigua debió haberla usado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REVIVER"
msgid "Did you ever hear the story about the beating heart hidden under the floorboards?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez escucharon la historia del corazón latiente escondido bajo las tablas del piso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL"
msgid "He's got a nose for this kind of work."
msgstr "Tiene un olfato especial para este tipo de trabajo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY"
msgid "Woby wants some too!"
msgstr "¡Woby también quiere!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Wonder how they got here?"
msgstr "Me pregunto cómo llegaron aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD"
msgid "Are you happy in my pocket?"
msgstr "¿Estás feliz en mi bolsillo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
msgid "My handbook doesn't show them in this colour..."
msgstr "En mi manual no aparecen de este color."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD"
msgid "They're extra downy."
msgstr "Estos son mucho más esponjosos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
msgid "Don't worry, a Pinetree Pioneer always helps those in need!"
msgstr "¡No te preocupes! ¡Un Pionero Pino siempre ayuda a aquellos que lo necesitan!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK"
msgid "It would be more useful in smaller pieces."
msgstr "Sería más útil en trozos más pequeños."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCKS"
msgid "Maybe I could make a fire pit."
msgstr "Quizá pueda hacer una fogata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCKY"
msgid "Wow! Look at you!"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¡Mírate nada más!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN"
msgid "I don't think it'll be making fruit anytime soon."
msgstr "No creo que produzca frutas pronto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "It's on fire!"
msgstr "¡Está que arde!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "Maybe that's how a moon bush is supposed to look?"
msgstr "Tal vez así es como se supone que deben verse los arbustos lunares."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "Is something wrong with it?"
msgstr "¿Le pasa algo malo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that tree growing... rocks?"
msgstr "¿A ese árbol le están saliendo... rocas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "We already gathered all the fruit."
msgstr "Ya recolectamos toda la fruta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "I don't think it likes the heat."
msgstr "Creo que no le gusta el calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT"
msgid "It's hard as a rock!"
msgstr "¡Es duro como una roca!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE"
msgid "It's finally ripe! ...I think."
msgstr "¡Por fin está maduro! Creo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED"
msgid "That's better."
msgstr "Así está mejor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT"
msgid "Oh, it's growing!"
msgstr "¡Oh, está creciendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
msgid "This will really give you the chills."
msgstr "Esto sí que te dará escalofríos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED"
msgid "Ice sometimes does that."
msgstr "El hielo a veces hace eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED"
msgid "Ice sometimes does that."
msgstr "El hielo a veces hace eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "A crusted over lava pit."
msgstr "Un pozo de lava dura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
msgid "The lava's crusting over."
msgstr "La lava se está secando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "Agradable y confortable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT"
msgid "Looks fragile."
msgstr "Parece frágil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON"
msgid "I wonder how it affects were-people. I should ask Mr. Woodie."
msgstr "Me pregunto qué efecto tiene sobre los hombres animal. Le preguntaré al Sr. Woodie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "What could've turned it to stone?"
msgstr "¿Qué lo habrá petrificado?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "What could've turned it to stone?"
msgstr "¿Qué lo habrá petrificado?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "I wonder how it works?"
msgstr "Me pregunto cómo funciona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Wow! It looks even more dangerous than the usual ones!"
msgstr "¡Caray! ¡Se ve incluso más peligrosa que las normales!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "An essential part of any adventuring kit."
msgstr "Una parte crucial del kit de aventuras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG"
msgid "That's definitely gone off."
msgstr "Eso definitivamente se echó a perder."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "It was a royal pain to get."
msgstr "Fue “real-mente” difícil de obtener."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "A bunch of really old rocks. I guess all rocks are old..."
msgstr "Es un montón de rocas muy antiguas. Creo que todas las rocas son antiguas..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "I'm the king! You have to listen to what I say!"
msgstr "¡Yo soy el rey! ¡Tienen que escuchar lo que les digo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "I was never great at baseball... but maybe I would be with a bat like this!"
msgstr "Nunca fui muy bueno en béisbol... ¡pero quizá lo sería con un bate como este!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "We can fix it up with some Pinetree Pioneer determination!"
msgstr "¡Podemos reparar esto con un poco de determinación de Pionero Pino!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "There HAS to be something good in there, just look at it!"
msgstr "TIENE que haber algo bueno ahí dentro. ¡Nada más miren ese cofre!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "How do we get it open? Any ideas, Woby?"
msgstr "¿Cómo lo abrimos? ¿Se te ocurre alguna idea, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "It can't be comfortable wearing a saddle all the time."
msgstr "No debe ser cómodo llevar puesta una silla de montar todo el tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "Guess you need a saddle to ride some animals."
msgstr "Supongo que necesitas una silla para montar ciertos animales."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "See? Bugs are helpful in lots of ways!"
msgstr "¿Lo ves? ¡Los bichos son útiles de muchas formas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "It's almost as comfy as sitting in Woby's fur."
msgstr "Es casi tan cómodo como estar sentado en el lomo de Woby."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALSA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALSA"
msgid "It only comes with one chip?!"
msgstr "¡¿Solo trae una papa?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX"
msgid "Salt is great for preserving your supplies."
msgstr "La sal es genial para conservar las provisiones."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "Don't eat that Woby, it's for the beefalo!"
msgstr "¡No te comas eso, Woby, es para el beefalo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK"
msgid "Hey, I think that's salt!"
msgstr "¡Oigan, creo que eso es sal!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe there's a Medusa nearby... a salt Medusa..."
msgstr "Tal vez hay una Medusa por aquí... una muy salada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "I'm glad they grow back!"
msgstr "¡Qué bueno que volvieron a crecer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
msgid "Nothing left to gather."
msgstr "No queda nada que recoger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Woah! How do you do that?"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¿Cómo haces eso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "Hey, careful! You almost hit me with that!"
msgstr "¡Oye, cuidado! ¡Casi me golpeas con eso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "Hey, where did that come from?"
msgstr "Oigan, ¿de dónde salió eso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "I swear there was something here a second ago."
msgstr "Juraría que había algo aquí hace un segundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "Someone grab some water!"
msgstr "¡Que alguien traiga agua!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "That doesn't look healthy."
msgstr "No parece estar muy sano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "Is it supposed to look like that?"
msgstr "¿Se supone que deba verse así?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a baby tree."
msgstr "Es un arbolito bebé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "Now it'll never grow into a tree."
msgstr "Ahora no se convertirá en un árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "I guess it's too hot out."
msgstr "Supongo que hace mucho calor afuera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "I guess that makes it look a little scarier."
msgstr "Creo que así da más miedo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Not much use to us now."
msgstr "Ya no nos sirve de nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Who'd be scared of that?"
msgstr "¿A quién le daría miedo esto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "I think the time for first aid has long passed."
msgstr "Creo que los primeros auxilios ya no servirían de mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "This doesn't look too hard! Or does it..."
msgstr "¡Esto no parece ser tan difícil! ¿O sí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Don't we have a perfectly good fire pit?"
msgstr "¿No habría sido mejor usar nuestra fogata?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Time for some arts and crafts."
msgstr "Hora del arte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "Hey Woby, look! I'm getting good at this!"
msgstr "¡Mira, Woby! ¡Le estoy agarrando el truco a esto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "One part of this statue looks older than the other."
msgstr "Una parte de esta estatua se ve más antigua que la otra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Finished!"
msgstr "¡Listo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "Huh? I think I hear something moving in there."
msgstr "¿Ah? Creo que oí algo moverse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "Can you sniff out the missing piece Woby?"
msgstr "¿Puedes rastrear la pieza faltante, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "What's that doing here?"
msgstr "¿Qué hace eso aquí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "There's something weird about it."
msgstr "Esto tiene algo extraño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "That looks better."
msgstr "Así está mejor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "Huh? I think I hear something moving in there."
msgstr "¿Ah? Creo que oí algo moverse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "It's all broken up."
msgstr "Está rota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "That's one way to get a head. Get it?"
msgstr "Creo que perdió la cabeza. ¿Entienden?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "I think there's something else hiding in that marble."
msgstr "Creo que hay algo más oculto en el mármol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "That was easy enough."
msgstr "Eso fue fácil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "Huh? I think I hear something moving in there."
msgstr "¿Ah? Creo que oí algo moverse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "There's something missing..."
msgstr "Aquí falta algo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "How did it get there?"
msgstr "¿Cómo llegó hasta allá?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT"
msgid "We should really be more careful with our resources."
msgstr "Deberíamos ser más cuidadosos con nuestros recursos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC"
msgid "We're going to need a better boat."
msgstr "Necesitaremos un bote mejor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
msgid "Packed full of flavour!"
msgstr "¡Tiene mucho sabor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK"
msgid "Rocks off the port bow!"
msgstr "¡Piedra a la vista!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "It's nice of the birds to share."
msgstr "Qué bueno que las aves compartan."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "You make do with what you have when you're out in the wilderness."
msgstr "Se hace lo que se puede con lo que se tiene en la selva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "Map making is so much more interesting here!"
msgstr "¡La cartografía es mucho más interesante aquí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "Better make sure all my badges are secure!"
msgstr "¡Debo asegurarme de que mis medallas estén bien cosidas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "It's so handy!"
msgstr "¡Es muy útil!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "I wish my shadow could help me with my chores."
msgstr "Ojalá mi sombra me ayudara con el trabajo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "Look at that! I wonder what's keeping it alive?"
msgstr "¡Miren eso! Me pregunto qué lo mantiene vivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHARK"
msgid "Just look at the size of those teeth!"
msgstr "¡Miren el tamaño de esos dientes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER"
msgid "Let's break it apart and see what's inside."
msgstr "Vamos a romperlo y ver qué hay dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "You never know what you'll find if you do a little digging."
msgstr "Nunca sabes qué puedes encontrar cuando excavas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "It's so weird! Can I keep it?"
msgstr "¡Qué raro es! ¿Puedo quedármelo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of supplies..."
msgstr "Qué desperdicio de materiales."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "A shady spot for a quick nap."
msgstr "Una buena sombra para una siesta rápida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "Spiders are pretty useful."
msgstr "Las arañas son muy útiles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC"
msgid "There's something inside it!"
msgstr "¡Hay algo dentro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe I could teach it to play some songs I learned in the Pioneers."
msgstr "Tal vez pueda enseñarle a tocar algunas canciones que aprendí en los Pioneros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that hard on your ears, Woby?"
msgstr "¿No te agrada el sonido, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC"
msgid "Yeah, that looks haunted."
msgstr "Sí, eso se ve embrujado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS"
msgid "That looks pretty nice."
msgstr "Eso se ve muy bonito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS"
msgid "If I find some flowers I'll bring them back here."
msgstr "Si encuentro algunas flores, las traeré aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON"
msgid "Is it a real skeleton?"
msgstr "¿Es un esqueleto de verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT"
msgid "Good thing they had such a thick skull, this makes a great helmet!"
msgstr "Qué bueno que eran cabeza dura. ¡Este será un excelente casco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT"
msgid "Poor %s. I guess %s might be more dangerous than I thought..."
msgstr "Pobre %s. Creo que %s representaba un peligro más grande del que pensaba..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE"
msgid "Poor %s. I guess %s might be more dangerous than I thought..."
msgstr "Pobre %s. Creo que %s representaba un peligro más grande del que pensaba..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE"
msgid "Poor %s. I guess %s might be more dangerous than I thought..."
msgstr "Pobre %s. Creo que %s representaba un peligro más grande del que pensaba..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT"
msgid "Poor %s. I guess %s might be more dangerous than I thought..."
msgstr "Pobre %s. Creo que %s representaba un peligro más grande del que pensaba..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKETCH"
msgid "I think I could sculpt this! I'm pretty good at arts and crafts."
msgstr "¡Creo que podría esculpir esto! Soy muy bueno con las manos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST"
msgid "There's got to be something good in there."
msgstr "Tiene que haber algo bueno ahí dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB"
msgid "It's more humane than a stink bomb."
msgstr "Esto es más misericordioso que una bomba apestosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT"
msgid "You never know what you'll run into out in the wilderness."
msgstr "Nunca sabes qué encontrarás en la selva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE"
msgid "Almost as chilling as my favourite radio shows!"
msgstr "¡Esto da tantos escalofríos como mis programas de radio favoritos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD"
msgid "These rounds are golden! Literally!"
msgstr "¡Estos proyectiles son oro puro! Literalmente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE"
msgid "I wish they weren't so hard to find!"
msgstr "¡Ojalá encontrarlos no fuese tan duro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP"
msgid "Gross... but a distraction is a distraction."
msgstr "Son asquerosos... pero una distracción es una distracción."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK"
msgid "They're not the best, but they'll work."
msgstr "No son los mejores, pero servirán."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW"
msgid "That should slow them down!"
msgstr "¡Esto debería ralentizarlo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE"
msgid "Shadow magic is pretty handy, I see why the Ancients liked it!"
msgstr "La magia de las sombras es muy útil. ¡Ya entiendo por qué a los Antiguos les gustaba!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "Hey little guy!"
msgstr "¡Hola, amiguito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "Does anyone know taxidermy?"
msgstr "¿Alguien sabe de taxidermia?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "Does anyone know taxidermy?"
msgstr "¿Alguien sabe de taxidermia?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "What is that slimy thing? I've gotta get a closer look!"
msgstr "¿Qué es esa cosa viscosa? ¡Debo verla más de cerca!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "This should keep my brain safe. Never know when you'll see a zombie."
msgstr "Esto debería mantener mis sesos a salvo. Nunca sabes cuándo te encontrarás a un zombi por ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "I have to see what's in there!"
msgstr "¡Tengo que ver lo que hay dentro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "Slurtle snot!"
msgstr "¡Moco de babortuga!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "Sorry slurtle."
msgstr "Lo siento, babortuga."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey little bird! Anything you want to tell me?"
msgstr "¡Hola, pajarito! ¿No hay nada que quieras decirme?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Feeling a bit... peckish? Heh... you know, because you're a bird?"
msgstr "¿Tiene ganas de picotear algo? Je, je... ¿entiendes?, porque eres un pájaro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "Shhh, you have to be extra quiet Woby."
msgstr "Shhh, debes ser muy silenciosa, Woby."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Oh no! Did I forget to feed you?"
msgstr "¡Ay, no! ¿Olvidé alimentarte?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST"
msgid "Maybe I should come back with someone who speaks ghost..."
msgstr "Quizá debería ir a buscar a alguien que hable “fantasmañol”."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "Just a little meat."
msgstr "Un trocito de carne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Barely a bite of jerky."
msgstr "Apenas y es un bocadito de carne seca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "This one's got bite."
msgstr "Lo mordieron."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "Hey little guy!"
msgstr "¡Hola, amiguito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "I bet you're really a big softie!"
msgstr "¡Apuesto a que en realidad eres muy blanda!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "It has a point... heh..."
msgstr "Es un arma de punta... je, je..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "I could do a quick charge with that."
msgstr "Podría hacer una embestida rápida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "It gets to the point."
msgstr "Va directo al grano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "No Woby, that's not a stick! Well, I guess it IS a stick..."
msgstr "¡No, Woby, eso no es una rama! Bueno, creo que sí es una rama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "Specialized spice traveling gear."
msgstr "Equipo de viaje especializado en especias."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI"
msgid "A little bit of spice never hurt anyone."
msgstr "Un poquito de picante no le hace daño a nadie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC"
msgid "It's good for you!"
msgstr "¡Es bueno para ti!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT"
msgid "It helps makes camp food a bit less bland."
msgstr "Ayuda a que la comida de campamento quede menos insípida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR"
msgid "Too much will make you sick."
msgstr "Si comes demasiada, te enfermarás."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "Aw, poor little guy."
msgstr "Ay, pobrecita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Woah, you're a big spider!"
msgstr "¡Vaya, eres una arañota!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Don't mind me!"
msgstr "¡No me hagas caso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "Hey, that must be where the spiders live! It's huge!"
msgstr "¡Miren, ahí es donde deben vivir las arañas! ¡Es enorme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "Aww, it's full of baby spiders!"
msgstr "¡Aay, está lleno de arañitas bebé!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "This would be a good addition to my first aid kit."
msgstr "Sería una buena adición para mi botiquín de primeros auxilios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "Woby keeps growling at me when I wear it..."
msgstr "Woby me gruñe cada vez que me lo pongo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "Someone needs to dust more often, everything's covered in cobwebs!"
msgstr "Alguien debería pasar un plumero por aquí más seguido. ¡Todo está cubierto de telarañas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "Someone needs to dust more often, everything's covered in cobwebs!"
msgstr "Alguien debería pasar un plumero por aquí más seguido. ¡Todo está cubierto de telarañas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "I've never heard of spiders having a queen, that's so interesting!"
msgstr "Nunca escuché que las arañas tuviesen reinas. ¡Qué interesante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "Woah! You startled me!"
msgstr "¡Uy! ¡Me asustaste!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "Woah! You startled me!"
msgstr "¡Uy! ¡Me asustaste!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD"
msgid "Aw, it's dead."
msgstr "Ay, está muerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Woah, how did they get like that? I need to get a closer look!"
msgstr "¡Caray! ¿Qué les pasó? ¡Necesito verlas más de cerca!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "I could probably get close while they're sleeping."
msgstr "Quizá pueda acercarme mientras duermen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "Ooooh! Look at you!"
msgstr "¡Uuuh! ¡Mírate!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "Sorry, you started it!"
msgstr "¡Lo siento, tú empezaste!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Look at the colouring on that one!"
msgstr "¡Miren los colores de esa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "I should probably leave them alone..."
msgstr "Creo que debería dejarlas en paz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH"
msgid "Ugh, rotten fish!"
msgstr "¡Puaj, pescado podrido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD"
msgid "I probably shouldn't eat this..."
msgstr "Creo que no debería comerme esto..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't eat the spores Woby, a mushtree might grow in your stomach!"
msgstr "¡No te comas las esporas, Woby, o te podría crecer un árbol de champiñón en la panza!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "The bugs in my pocket might like some light."
msgstr "A los bichos en mi bolsillo les vendría bien un poco de luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Swamp gas! Oh, it's just some more spores."
msgstr "¡Gas de pantano! Ah, solo son más esporas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "The bugs in my pocket might like some light."
msgstr "A los bichos en mi bolsillo les vendría bien un poco de luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Hope I don't accidentally swallow one."
msgstr "Espero no tragarme una por accidente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "The bugs in my pocket might like some light."
msgstr "A los bichos en mi bolsillo les vendría bien un poco de luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "I wonder if that's their full size, or if these are just babies..."
msgstr "Me pregunto si ese es su tamaño adulto o si apenas son bebés."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "I just got a chill up my spine."
msgstr "Acabo de sentir un escalofrío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "Almost better than a campfire."
msgstr "Es casi mejor que una fogata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "What a pane... heh."
msgstr "Hoy hay pronóstico de tormenta. Je, je."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "Maybe it wants to roast marshmallows too?"
msgstr "Tal vez quiera asar malvaviscos también."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "Woby, what's wrong? It's just a table."
msgstr "Woby, ¿qué sucede? Es solo una mesa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "People get stalagmites and stalactites confused, but I know which is which!"
msgstr "Las personas siempre confunden las estalagmitas con las estalactitas, ¡pero yo sí sé diferenciarlas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "It's a really tall... one of these!"
msgstr "¡Qué alta es esta... cosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "A real living skeleton!"
msgstr "¡Un esqueleto viviente de verdad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "Maybe he knows something about the bug people that lived here!"
msgstr "Tal vez sepa algo de los hombres insecto que habitaron aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "I wonder if I can catch one!"
msgstr "¡Me pregunto si puedo atrapar uno!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Lo siento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks just like him!"
msgstr "¡Es igualito al real!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "I don't think it has an ear for music. Heh... good one, Walter."
msgstr "No creo que tenga oído musical. Je, je... buena esa, Walter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "I'm starting to think that Maxwell guy might be a bit full of himself."
msgstr "Estoy empezando a creer que ese tal Maxwell es un poco creído."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder who made these?"
msgstr "Me pregunto quién las esculpió."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "It looks like something from a museum."
msgstr "Parece algo salido de un museo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "It's nice, I guess."
msgstr "Es bonita, supongo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "That one's just asking for birds to land on it."
msgstr "Esa pide a gritos que las aves se le posen encima."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "For making especially scratchy sweaters."
msgstr "Para hacer suéteres que piquen terriblemente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Come on First Mate Woby, we're going sailing!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, primer oficial de cubierta Woby, nos vamos a navegar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "It's probably a good idea to add a steering wheel."
msgstr "Sería una buena idea incluir un timón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "Aaaaah! Keep it away, please!"
msgstr "¡Aaaahh! ¡Aléjenlo de mí, por favor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "That hat would never pass uniform inspection."
msgstr "Ese sombrero nunca pasaría una inspección de uniforme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "A vegetable stuffed with more vegetable."
msgstr "Una verdura rellena con más verdura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "I could stuff a bit more in my mouth."
msgstr "Podría llenarme y rellenarme la boca con esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "They're pretty useful for minor cuts and burns."
msgstr "Son excelentes para quemadas y cortes pequeños."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "They're from the cactus family!"
msgstr "¡Forman parte de la familia de los cactus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "I guess it's nice. I prefer plants outdoors though."
msgstr "Supongo que está bien, pero prefiero las plantas sembradas en el suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "How did this clam get so big?"
msgstr "¿Cómo creció tanto esta almeja?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "I can't get it open."
msgstr "No puedo abrirlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "So organized!"
msgstr "¡Qué organizado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "So filling!"
msgstr "¡Es muy sustancioso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "This doesn't look like good adventuring wear."
msgstr "No parece una ropa adecuada para salir en una aventura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "It just isn't the holidays without it!"
msgstr "¡Las festividades no serían lo mismo sin él!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Who's the Scrooge that ruined the feast?"
msgstr "¿Quién fue el Grinch que arruinó el banquete?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "The table's all set and ready for food!"
msgstr "¡La mesa está preparada y lista para la comida!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "Dig in, everybody!"
msgstr "¡Todos a comer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "We can eat that anytime, Winter's Feast should be special!"
msgstr "Podemos comernos eso en otro momento. ¡El Banquete Festivo debe ser especial!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "It's got room for all my tackle."
msgstr "Tiene espacio para todo mi equipo de pesca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "This looks pretty easy to make."
msgstr "Esto parece bastante fácil de hacer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "Not to brag, but I do have my fishing badge."
msgstr "No es por alardear, pero tengo una medalla de pesca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "Don't eat too much or you'll get a stomach ache."
msgstr "No coman demasiado o les dará dolor de barriga."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "Woah! Do you fly? Or are you more like an ostrich?"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¿Puedes volar? ¿O eres más como un avestruz?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "What a huge egg!"
msgstr "¡Qué huevo tan gigante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "That's just how nature goes sometimes."
msgstr "Eso pasa a veces en la naturaleza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Come on Woby, help me warm it up."
msgstr "Vamos, Woby. Ayúdame a calentarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "It's hatching! It's really hatching!"
msgstr "¡Está eclosionando! ¡Sí está eclosionando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "Uh oh, it's going to be a fried egg if we don't cool it down."
msgstr "Oh, oh. Terminará siendo huevo frito si no lo enfriamos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "How long does it take for these to hatch?"
msgstr "¿Cuánto tiempo se tarda esto en eclosionar?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "It'll hatch any day now, I'm positive!"
msgstr "Cualquier día de estos va a eclosionar. ¡Estoy seguro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "She was protecting her nest..."
msgstr "Protegía su nido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "Invisible eggs? Oh, no it's just empty."
msgstr "¿Son huevos invisibles? Oh, no. Solo está vacío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "Woah, these are tasty!"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¡Están deliciosos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "Nobody understands us, do they?"
msgstr "Nadie nos entiende, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Hungry? I'll see what I have."
msgstr "¿Tienes hambre? Veré qué tengo para darte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep well!"
msgstr "¡Duerme bien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "They're just grouchy because they're hungry."
msgstr "Está malhumorado porque tiene hambre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "Come on Woby, let's find some purple gems."
msgstr "Vamos, Woby. Busquemos gemas púrpuras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "Everything's ready!"
msgstr "¡Todo está listo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "Come on Woby, we've got some exploring to do!"
msgstr "Vamos, Woby. ¡Tenemos mucho que explorar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "That definitely looks like a magical... something."
msgstr "Definitivamente parece... algo mágico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "Hm, it still needs something..."
msgstr "Mmm... aún le falta algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "I think I've almost got it, Woby!"
msgstr "¡Creo que ya casi está listo, Woby!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "I wonder what's inside?"
msgstr "Me pregunto qué habrá dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "This looks complicated..."
msgstr "Esto se ve complejo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "What is this supposed to be, exactly?"
msgstr "¿Exactamente qué se supone que sea esto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "This looks important."
msgstr "Esto parece importante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "But getting there is half the fun!"
msgstr "¡Pero llegar hasta allá es parte de la diversión!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "I guess I set it up too close to the campfire."
msgstr "Creo que la armé demasiado cerca de la fogata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "I always sleep better in a tent."
msgstr "Siempre duermo mejor en una tienda de campaña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "I want to see the creature it's attached to!"
msgstr "¡Quiero ver a la criatura dueña de esto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "A souvenir from the swamp creature."
msgstr "Un recuerdo de la criatura del pantano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "You can find a use for almost anything in nature."
msgstr "A todo lo que hay en la naturaleza se le puede encontrar un uso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "That's a weird looking pillar."
msgstr "Es un pilar muy extraño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "I kind of want to poke it."
msgstr "Tengo ganas de tocarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "Are these all from the same creature?"
msgstr "¿Todas provienen de la misma criatura?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "Hey, there's a tunnel! Let's go Woby!"
msgstr "¡Oigan, hay un túnel! ¡Vamos, Woby!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "Rocks from an ancient civilization!"
msgstr "Rocas de una civilización antigua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "Woby, keep your eyes peeled for any more of these little pieces!"
msgstr "¡Woby, está atenta por más piecitas como esta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "Oof, that's a strong smell."
msgstr "¡Caray! Qué olor tan intenso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "A real giant frog monster!"
msgstr "¡Un verdadero monstruo rana gigante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "I don't think he likes us very much."
msgstr "Creo que no le caemos muy bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "What's wrong, Woby? It's just a normal hole in the ground."
msgstr "¿Qué sucede, Woby? Es solo un agujero en el suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't be so skittish Woby, it's just a toadstool!"
msgstr "No seas tan asustadiza, Woby. ¡Solo es un champiñón venenoso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "Hey! What's that in there?"
msgstr "¡Oigan! ¿Qué es eso de ahí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "Mom had some tomato plants in our backyard."
msgstr "Mi mamá tenía algunas plantas de tomate en nuestro jardín."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "That just made it squishier..."
msgstr "Lo único que hizo fue ponerlo más blando..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Where should we plant them, Woby?"
msgstr "¿Dónde deberíamos sembrarlas, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "Seems a bit out of place out here in the wilderness."
msgstr "No combina para nada con el escenario."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "Is this what they use in England instead of flashlights?"
msgstr "¿Esto era lo que usaban en vez de linternas en Inglaterra?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "My cousin from the East Coast made these for us once, they're the best!"
msgstr "Una vez mi primo de la Costa Este nos lo preparó. ¡Es excelente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "Let's go!"
msgstr "¡Vamos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Ready for a journey into the unknown Woby?"
msgstr "¿Estás lista para ir en un viaje hacia lo desconocido, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "It's ready to take us somewhere!"
msgstr "¡Está listo para llevarnos a algún lugar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "No wonder she was grumpy, there was a pit in her stomach!"
msgstr "Ya entiendo por qué estaba tan molesto; ¡tenía un hueco en el estómago!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "The snack of choice for all intrepid explorers!"
msgstr "¡La botana preferida de todos los exploradores intrépidos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "He's got a strong arm on him."
msgstr "Tiene un brazo fuerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "Of course I know what it is! It's uh... um..."
msgstr "¡Claro que sé qué es! Es un... un..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "We learned how to make them in the Pinetree Pioneers."
msgstr "Aprendimos a hacerlas en los Pioneros Pino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "He's pretty good at this!"
msgstr "¡Es muy bueno haciendo este tipo de cosas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "H-hey, be careful!"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¡Ten cuidado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "I love starfish!"
msgstr "¡Me encantan las estrellas de mar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "We didn't make traps like these in the Pinetree Pioneers..."
msgstr "No hicimos trampas así en los Pioneros Pino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "That could hurt someone!"
msgstr "¡Eso podría herir a alguien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "My stuff!!"
msgstr "¡Mis cosas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "It isn't a toy chest, it's a very grownup SUPPLY chest."
msgstr "No es un cofre de juguete. Es un cofre de suministros de gente ADULTA."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "There might be cursed pirate gold inside!"
msgstr "¡Puede que tenga dentro oro pirata maldito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "Come on, trees! I just want to see what's over there!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, árboles! ¡Solo quiero ver qué hay allá!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "This looks like it could cause some damage."
msgstr "Esto parece que puede herir a alguien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "These will make perfect slingshot ammo."
msgstr "Serán la munición perfecta para la resortera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "I'm sure these will bring a smile to someone's face. Get it?"
msgstr "Estoy seguro que esto hará que alguien sonría. ¿Entienden?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "He said he loves when I talk about my bug collection!"
msgstr "¡Dijo que le gustaba cuando le hablaba sobre mi colección de insectos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "Still wriggling."
msgstr "Todavía se retuerce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "I thought she was looking the other way a second ago..."
msgstr "Podría jurar que estaba mirando hacia el otro lado hace un segundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "My mom would kill me if I cracked her fine china."
msgstr "Mi mamá me mataría si rompiera su fina vajilla de porcelana."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "I'm not really interested in board games."
msgstr "No me llaman mucho la atención los juegos de mesa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "I'm not really interested in board games."
msgstr "No me llaman mucho la atención los juegos de mesa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "One less utensil to pack with your camping gear!"
msgstr "¡Un utensilio menos que llevar en tu equipo de acampar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "Seems like a normal wooden horse."
msgstr "Parece un caballo de madera normal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "I'm too mature for toys."
msgstr "Soy demasiado maduro para tener juguetes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "I'd rather have a bugle."
msgstr "Preferiría tener un clarín."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "Woby likes it."
msgstr "A Woby le gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "Whoops, it got kind of bent."
msgstr "Uy. Está un poco inclinado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "I like a good yarn. Heh..."
msgstr "Me gustan las historias que tienen un buen hilo conductor. Je, je."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "Protect your heels!"
msgstr "¡Protégete los talones!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "Woby doesn't seem to like it very much."
msgstr "A Woby no le gusta mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "It doesn't even smell like a real pine tree!"
msgstr "¡Ni siquiera huele a pino de verdad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "One less dish to wash!"
msgstr "¡Un plato menos que lavar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "I wonder if I can use it to pick up radio signals..."
msgstr "Me pregunto si podría utilizarlo para captar señales de radio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "I'm not really interested in board games."
msgstr "No me llaman mucho la atención los juegos de mesa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "I'm not really interested in board games."
msgstr "No me llaman mucho la atención los juegos de mesa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "That's easy, I know how to tie lots of knots!"
msgstr "Eso es fácil. ¡Sé cómo atar muchos tipos de nudos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "They're kind of boring once you've seen the bigger version."
msgstr "Es un poco soso después de haber visto la versión grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "They're kind of boring once you've seen the bigger version."
msgstr "Es un poco soso después de haber visto la versión grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "Will it tell me my future?"
msgstr "¿Me dirá mi futuro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "Aw, I thought it was a real spider..."
msgstr "Ay. Creí que era una araña de verdad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "Nothing bad ever happened from wishing on a monkey's paw!"
msgstr "¡Nunca ha pasado nada malo por pedirle un deseo a una pata de mono!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Looks like someone already drank it."
msgstr "Parece que alguien ya se lo bebió."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "Those are just fakes, I want to see real vampire teeth!"
msgstr "Son de mentira. ¡Quiero ver dientes de vampiro reales!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "I hope the vampire's okay."
msgstr "Espero que el vampiro esté bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "I can almost see into space with these!"
msgstr "¡Casi puedo ver el espacio con estos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "I guess my hands can take turns."
msgstr "Imagino que mis manos pueden turnarse para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "Is it just me, or do his eyes follow me around?"
msgstr "¿Soy yo o sus ojos me están siguiendo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "I don't know what we'd be measuring out here."
msgstr "No sé qué vamos a pesar aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "Looks like a slime monster escaped."
msgstr "Parece que un monstruo de baba se escapó."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "It looks like someone mashed two toys together."
msgstr "Parece que alguien combinó dos juguetes distintos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "Another toy that I'm way too mature for."
msgstr "Otro juguete para el que soy demasiado maduro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "Huh. I can't find that plant in my handbook."
msgstr "¿Ah? Esa planta no sale en mi manual."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "It doesn't pick up any of my favourite stations..."
msgstr "No recibe ninguna de mis estaciones favoritas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "It looks like something from outer space."
msgstr "Parece algo del espacio exterior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "I wonder if we'll ever explore outer space."
msgstr "Me pregunto si alguna vez exploraremos el espacio exterior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "Uh oh, did the robot drop these?"
msgstr "Oh, oh. ¿Se le cayeron al robot?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "That's kid stuff."
msgstr "Son cosas de niños."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "I'm sure I'll find a use for it."
msgstr "Estoy seguro de que le encontraré un uso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "Never know when you'll need a spare button."
msgstr "Nunca se sabe cuándo necesitarás un botón de repuesto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING"
msgid "The fire is off the-- well actually it's ON the scale, that's the problem!"
msgstr "El peso de ese incendio es incalculable... Bueno, sí se podría calcular si no estuviese quemando la balanza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of supplies."
msgstr "Qué desperdicio de suministros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Just wait, that biggest fish badge will be mine!"
msgstr "Esperen y verán. ¡La medalla del pez más grande será mía!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "Peso: {weight}\nAtrapado por: {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nIt's almost as heavy as you, Woby!"
msgstr "Peso: {weight}\nAtrapado por: {owner}\n¡Es casi tan pesado como tú, Woby!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER"
msgid "I win! Where's my badge?\nWeight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "¡Gané! ¿Y mi medalla?\nPeso: {weight}\nAtrapado por: {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nPretty impressive, huh Woby?"
msgstr "Peso: {weight}\nAtrapado por: {owner}\nEs muy impresionante, ¿no, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "Now we're both fuzzy, Woby!"
msgstr "¡Ahora los dos somos peludos, Woby!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "A warm nose cozy."
msgstr "Para mantenerte abrigado hasta la trompa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "Thankfully booger-free. I think..."
msgstr "Por suerte, está libre de mocos, creo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "The fur's a little patchy."
msgstr "Este pelaje es algo desigual."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "It's full of nose hair."
msgstr "Está llena de pelo de nariz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "It's just minding its own business."
msgstr "Está enfocado en sus cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR"
msgid "This reminds me of my living room back home."
msgstr "Esto me recuerda al salón de mi casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE"
msgid "A patch of... underground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de... subsuelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "Finally something fireproof!"
msgstr "¡Por fin, algo incombustible!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOREST"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_GREEN"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_RED"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_GRASS"
msgid "A patch of grass."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo pastoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_MARSH"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_METEOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_METEOR"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_MUD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_MUD"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_PEBBLEBEACH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_PEBBLEBEACH"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROAD"
msgid "Some road."
msgstr "El mismo camino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROCKY"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_SANDY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_SANDY"
msgid "Some sand."
msgstr "Un poco de arena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_SAVANNA"
msgid "A patch of grass."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo pastoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK"
msgid "A patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pedazo de suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR"
msgid "Some floorboards."
msgstr "Unas duelas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER"
msgid "If you're good I'll give you a drumstick, Woby."
msgstr "Si te portas bien, te daré un muslo, Woby."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURNIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURNIP"
msgid "Huh... Turnip would be a good name for a dog."
msgstr "Ah... “Nabo” es un buen nombre para un perro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED"
msgid "Tasty turnips."
msgstr "Deliciosos nabos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS"
msgid "Where should we plant them, Woby?"
msgstr "¿Dónde deberíamos sembrarlas, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS"
msgid "Its shell is so spiky!"
msgstr "¡Cuántas espinas tiene el caparazón!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING"
msgid "You're supposed to chop the tree first, THEN build the fire!"
msgstr "Se supone que primero cortes el árbol ¡y LUEGO hagas la fogata!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT"
msgid "That tree just couldn't wait to be a campfire..."
msgstr "Ese árbol no pudo esperar a convertirse en fogata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "This tree looks stumped. Heh, nice one Walter."
msgstr "Qué árbol más tocón. Je, je. Buena esa, Walter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED"
msgid "Maybe it's infested with beetles. I should check!"
msgstr "Quizás está infestado de escarabajos. ¡Debería revisar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's more like a big stick than a tree."
msgstr "Parece más una rama grande que un árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT"
msgid "Hey Woby, you dig a hole and I'll plant it."
msgstr "Oye, Woby, tú cavas un hoyo y yo la siembro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING"
msgid "It'll grow up into a big tree someday."
msgstr "Crecerá para ser un gran árbol algún día."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD"
msgid "It's barely holding together."
msgstr "A duras penas se mantiene vivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TWIGS"
msgid "A handful of useful twigs."
msgstr "Un puñado de ramitas útiles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA"
msgid "It'll stop the raindrops from falling on my head."
msgstr "Impedirá que las gotas de lluvia caigan sobre mi cabeza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.UNAGI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.UNAGI"
msgid "Bite-sized deliciousness."
msgstr "Una exquisitez en miniatura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "It's so mysterious!"
msgstr "¡Qué misterioso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER"
msgid "I've never had a spicy drink before."
msgstr "Nunca antes había probado una bebida picante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY"
msgid "It definitely has a zing to it."
msgstr "Tiene algo de chispa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES"
msgid "Breakfast!"
msgstr "¡Desayuno!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK"
msgid "Oh, I'm good at diving! I got a badge for it!"
msgstr "¡Oh, soy bueno en clavado! ¡Me dieron una medalla por eso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT"
msgid "That's what I get for making a wall out of kindling..."
msgstr "Eso me pasa por hacer una pared con leña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC"
msgid "You make do with what you have when you're in the wilderness."
msgstr "Tienes que apañártelas con lo que encuentras cuando estás en la selva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM"
msgid "It's better than nothing!"
msgstr "¡Es mejor que nada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK"
msgid "It came from another world!"
msgstr "¡Proviene de otro mundo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM"
msgid "I can't believe we're making walls out of real moon rock!"
msgstr "¡No puedo creer que estamos construyendo paredes con rocas lunares reales!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS"
msgid "I like the spooky atmosphere."
msgstr "Me gusta esta atmósfera espeluznante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM"
msgid "Want to give me a hand with these, Woby?"
msgstr "¿Me quieres ayudar con esto, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE"
msgid "Looks pretty sturdy."
msgstr "Parece bastante robusto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM"
msgid "This will make a swell wall for our camp."
msgstr "Esto será una pared genial para nuestro campamento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT"
msgid "Our camp!!"
msgstr "¡¡Nuestro campamento!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Hope nobody hurts themselves if they try to climb over."
msgstr "Espero que nadie se haga daño si intenta escalar por ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM"
msgid "Looks sharp."
msgstr "Se ve afilado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS"
msgid "I need a closer look at those tusks!"
msgstr "¡Tengo que mirar más de cerca esos colmillos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT"
msgid "It's very... plaid?"
msgstr "¿Es muy... escocés?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY"
msgid "An abandoned campsite... I wonder who was here?"
msgstr "Un campamento abandonado. Me pregunto quién vivió aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC"
msgid "I've heard of houses like this, but I've never seen one!"
msgstr "He oído hablar de este tipo de casas, ¡pero nunca había visto una!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK"
msgid "Oof... I don't think he brushed."
msgstr "Uy. Creo que no se lavaba los dientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Hey, that's not how a Pinetree Pioneer acts!"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¡Así no se comporta un Pionero Pino!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s! Did you not get your fire safety badge yet?"
msgstr "¡%s! Aún no te has ganado la medalla de prevención contra incendios, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s! You kind of remind me of someone..."
msgstr "¡Hola, %s! Me recuerdas a alguien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST"
msgid "I'll get you fixed up lickety-split!"
msgstr "¡Te devolveré a la normalidad en un santiamén!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER"
msgid "You'll be kicked out of the Pioneers for this, %s!"
msgstr "¡Te botarán de los Pioneros por esto, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER"
msgid "I knew I could count on a fellow Pinetree Pioneer."
msgstr "Sabía que podía contar con un compañero Pionero Pino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT"
msgid "A Pinetree Pioneer should always wear appropriate headgear."
msgstr "Un Pionero Pino siempre debe llevar el sombrero adecuado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING"
msgid "My bugs!!"
msgstr "¡¡Mis insectos!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT"
msgid "Poor little guys..."
msgstr "Pobrecitos..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC"
msgid "I've been keeping my bugs in there when I run out of room in my pockets."
msgstr "Guardo mis insectos ahí cuando no tengo espacio en los bolsillos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARG"
msgid "Are they a friend of yours, Woby?"
msgstr "¿Es amigo tuyo, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING"
msgid "Who left the torch unattended?!"
msgstr "¿Quién dejó de supervisar la antorcha?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Well... that's that I guess."
msgstr "Bueno... así es la vida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It seems to respond to torchlight."
msgstr "Parece que responde a la luz de la antorcha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What should we make, Woby?"
msgstr "¿Qué hacemos, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER"
msgid "You seem kind of cranky Mr. %s, maybe you should eat something?"
msgstr "Se ve algo molesto, Sr. %s. Quizá debería comer algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You're burning it, Mr. %s!"
msgstr "¡Se le está quemando, Sr. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey Mr. %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, Sr. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST"
msgid "Hang on Mr. %s! You'll be back to cooking fancy food in no time."
msgstr "Espere, Sr. %s. Pronto estará cocinando comida sofisticada otra vez."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER"
msgid "How long have you been cooking up this murderous scheme, Mr. %s?"
msgstr "¿Durante cuánto tiempo ha estado cocinando esa treta asesina, Sr. %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks Mr. %s! That really hit the spot."
msgstr "¡Gracias, Sr. %s! Su preparación fue perfecta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE"
msgid "E-everyone stay calm... we'll be on our way..."
msgstr "No pierdan la calma... ya nos largamos de aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON"
msgid "Don't worry, I have great aim! Or maybe you should be worried..."
msgstr "No se preocupen, tengo muy buena puntería. O quizá sí deberían preocuparse..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON"
msgid "A sweet, refreshing snack!"
msgstr "¡Una botana dulce y refrescante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT"
msgid "This feels silly..."
msgstr "Se ve tonto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE"
msgid "Further proof that all food is better on a stick!"
msgstr "¡Otra prueba de que la comida siempre sabe mejor si está en un palito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED"
msgid "It's still sweet, but not as refreshing..."
msgstr "Sigue siendo dulce, pero no es tan refrescante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS"
msgid "Those look like melon seeds."
msgstr "Parecen semillas de sandía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT"
msgid "Woah! That flower is huge!"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¡Esa flor es gigante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY"
msgid "I think I'm getting better at gardening!"
msgstr "¡Creo que estoy mejorando en esto de la jardinería!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB"
msgid "Hey! Careful with those!"
msgstr "¡Oigan, tengan cuidado con esas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER"
msgid "Don't worry, we'll find a nice rock to plant you on."
msgstr "No te preocupes, encontraremos una buena roca donde plantarte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP"
msgid "It's always good to have proper safety precautions in place."
msgstr "Siempre es bueno tener preparados los accesorios contra incendios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER"
msgid "Ms. %s seems even more combative than usual..."
msgstr "La Sra. %s hoy parece estar más agresiva que de costumbre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Not everything needs to have a Viking funeral, Ms. %s!"
msgstr "¡No a todo hay que hacerle un funeral vikingo, Sra. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey Ms. %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, Sra. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST"
msgid "Don't worry Ms. %s! Woby and I will get a heart for you in no time."
msgstr "¡No se preocupe, Sra. %s! Woby y yo le traeremos un corazón en un segundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER"
msgid "Ms. %s went into a Viking rage!"
msgstr "¡La Sra. %s tiene un fuerte episodio de furia vikinga!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks Ms. %s! You're the only Viking I know, but also the best one!"
msgstr "¡Gracias, Sra. %s! Es la única vikinga que conozco, ¡y también la mejor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT"
msgid "Maybe Pinetree Pioneers should start wearing helmets instead."
msgstr "Quizá los Pioneros Pino deberían empezar a usar cascos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER"
msgid "Mom used to use something like this for baking."
msgstr "Mi mamá solía utilizar algo así cuando horneaba algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER"
msgid "Your dark side is showing, %s."
msgstr "Ahora sí estás mostrando tu lado oscuro, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Doesn't anyone care about fire safety?"
msgstr "¿Es que ya a nadie le importan las medidas de protección contra incendios?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey Mr. %s! Woby, stop growling at him!"
msgstr "¡Hola, Sr. %s! ¡Woby, deja de gruñirle!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST"
msgid "Don't worry, a Pinetree Pioneer doesn't leave anyone behind!"
msgstr "No se preocupe. Un Pionero Pino nunca deja a nadie atrás."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER"
msgid "You're a monster, and not the fun kind."
msgstr "Eres un monstruo, y no del tipo divertido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER"
msgid "I was kind of having fun being a ghost..."
msgstr "Era divertido ser un fantasma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL"
msgid "Maybe you could teach me some magic tricks? I'm a quick learner!"
msgstr "Quizá podría enseñarme algunos trucos de magia. ¡Aprendo rápido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER"
msgid "I guess he IS a monster... it's only natural."
msgstr "Creo que SÍ es un monstruo. Bueno, es natural en él."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "We need to have a group meeting about fire safety."
msgstr "Necesitamos tener una reunión sobre seguridad contra incendios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST"
msgid "Don't worry little guy, Woby and I will take care of it."
msgstr "No te preocupes, amiguito. Woby y yo te ayudaremos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER"
msgid "Hey %s! That's going too far!"
msgstr "¡Oye, %s! ¡Te pasaste de la raya!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks for the help! You'll make a great Pinetree Pioneer someday!"
msgstr "¡Gracias por tu ayuda! ¡Serás un gran Pionero Pino algún día!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL"
msgid "No Woby, these bones aren't for chewing on!"
msgstr "¡No, Woby, no puedes mordisquear esos huesos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION"
msgid "I guess they're fighting for us."
msgstr "Supongo que están luchando por nosotros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER"
msgid "You can't scare me... okay, maybe a little."
msgstr "No me asustas. Bueno, quizá sí. Un poquito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Fire safety isn't that hard!!"
msgstr "¡Tomar medidas de protección contra incendios no es tan difícil!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST"
msgid "Oh, it's... kind of hard to tell you two apart."
msgstr "Oh. Es... un poco difícil distinguir quién es quién."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER"
msgid "You... how could you do that?"
msgstr "¿Cómo pudiste hacer eso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER"
msgid "Being a ghost isn't so bad, I can see why Abigail likes it!"
msgstr "Ser fantasma no está tan mal. ¡Ya entiendo por qué a Abigail le gusta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER"
msgid "I knew the Werebeaver was real! Nobody believed me!"
msgstr "¡Sabía que el Hombre Castor era real! ¡Nadie me creía!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE"
msgid "Yeah that... definitely looks cursed."
msgstr "Sí, eso definitivamente está maldito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE"
msgid "So how does the curse work? When did it start?"
msgstr "¿Cómo funciona la maldición? ¿Cuándo empezó?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER"
msgid "This is why I don't trust clowns!"
msgstr "¡Por eso no confío en los payasos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "That's not a proper campfire, %s!"
msgstr "¡Así no se hace una fogata, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC"
msgid "Uh... hi %s."
msgstr "Eh... hola, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST"
msgid "A Pinetree Pioneer leaves no one behind! Even if they're a clown!"
msgstr "Un Pionero Pino no deja a nadie atrás, ¡ni aunque sea un payaso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER"
msgid "%s is a killer clown!"
msgstr "¡%s es un payaso asesino!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER"
msgid "I guess some clowns are okay."
msgstr "Creo que los payasos no son tan malos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP"
msgid "Er... maybe Woby will want it..."
msgstr "Eh... quizá Woby sí lo quiera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER"
msgid "Better than a wet blanket! Heh... good one Walter."
msgstr "¿Y escribes sobre él con un lápiz mojado? Je, je. Buena esa, Walter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH"
msgid "Ugh, it's falling apart!"
msgstr "Ay. ¡Se deshace!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WHIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WHIP"
msgid "I know how you feel about cats Woby, but it still seems pretty mean."
msgstr "Sé cómo te sientes respecto a los gatos, Woby, pero aun así me parece bastante cruel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER"
msgid "Is this because I said the radio will make books obsolete?"
msgstr "¿Hace esto porque dije que la radio haría que los libros quedaran obsoletos?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Not you too, Ms. %s!!"
msgstr "¡¿Usted también, Sra. %s?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello Ms. %s! Need any help crossing the street?"
msgstr "¡Hola, Sra. %s! ¿Necesita que la ayude a cruzar la calle?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST"
msgid "Well, she lived a long life... okay, okay, stop glaring! I'll get a heart!"
msgstr "Bueno, tuvo una vida larga... Bien, bien. ¡Deje de mirarme así! ¡Le buscaré un corazón!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER"
msgid "Attack of the killer librarian!"
msgstr "¡El ataque de la bibliotecaria asesina!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks Ms. %s!"
msgstr "¡Gracias, Sra. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s? Why are you looking at me like that...?"
msgstr "%s, ¿por qué me estás mirando así?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You said you were listening when I was talking about fire safety!"
msgstr "¡Dijiste que me estabas escuchando cuando hablé sobre las medidas de protección contra incendios!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST"
msgid "Woby, fetch! A heart! ...Okay, I'll get it myself."
msgstr "¡Woby, trae! ¡Trae un corazón! Bueno, lo buscaré yo mismo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER"
msgid "Get her Woby! She's a killer!"
msgstr "¡Atrápala, Woby! ¡Es una asesina!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER"
msgid "Now I know why Woby likes you!"
msgstr "¡Ahora sé por qué le gustas a Woby!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER"
msgid "I thought he seemed alright... maybe I was wrong."
msgstr "Pensé que era buena persona. Quizás estaba equivocado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Nobody here knows how to build a proper campfire."
msgstr "Nadie aquí sabe cómo construir una verdadera fogata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey Mr. %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, Sr. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST"
msgid "What's it like being a ghost, Mr. %s? Oh, right, I'll get you a heart."
msgstr "¿Qué se siente ser un fantasma, Sr. %s? Oh, cierto. Le buscaré un corazón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER"
msgid "Is it true, Mr. %s? Are you a scientist gone mad?"
msgstr "¿Es verdad, Sr. %s? ¿Es un científico que se volvió loco?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks Mr. %s! Did you take good care of Woby?"
msgstr "¡Gracias, Sr. %s! ¿Cuidó bien de Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC"
msgid "This is how we'll catch a sea monster!"
msgstr "¡Así atraparemos un monstruo marino!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM"
msgid "Well... it's not a sea monster."
msgstr "Bueno... no es un monstruo marino..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM"
msgid "Please be a sea monster, please be a sea monster..."
msgstr "Por favor, que sea un monstruo marino, que sea un monstruo marino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER"
msgid "You're making Woby nervous, Ms. %s..."
msgstr "Está poniendo nerviosa a Woby, Sra. %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Uh, Ms. %s... that's not how you make a campfire."
msgstr "Mmm... Sra. %s, así no se hace una fogata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey Ms. %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, Sra. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST"
msgid "We didn't cover this in first aid, but I'm sure I can figure it out!"
msgstr "Esto no lo vimos en la clase de primeros auxilios, ¡pero estoy seguro de que puedo ayudarla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER"
msgid "Watch out Woby, she's a murderer!"
msgstr "¡Cuidado, Woby, es una asesina!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks for patching me up, Ms. %s!"
msgstr "¡Gracias por curarme, Sra. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING"
msgid "Ah!! That's how forest fires start!"
msgstr "¡Ah! ¡Así comienzan los incendios forestales!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT"
msgid "Well... I guess Winona'll have to build a new one."
msgstr "Bueno, creo que Winona tendrá que construir una nueva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC"
msgid "How does it work?"
msgstr "¿Cómo funciona?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER"
msgid "I think we need to hook up a another generator to this generator."
msgstr "Creo que tenemos que conectarle otro generador a este generador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF"
msgid "It ran out of gem power."
msgstr "Se le agotó el poder de la gema."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING"
msgid "Ah!! That's how forest fires start!"
msgstr "¡Ah! ¡Así comienzan los incendios forestales!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT"
msgid "Well... I guess Winona'll have to build a new one."
msgstr "Bueno, creo que Winona tendrá que construir una nueva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC"
msgid "A generator! Do you think she could make a radio too...?"
msgstr "¡Un generador! ¿Creen que también pueda hacer una radio?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER"
msgid "I think we need to hook up a another generator to this generator."
msgstr "Creo que tenemos que conectarle otro generador a este generador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF"
msgid "It stopped working."
msgstr "Dejó de funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING"
msgid "Ah!! That's how forest fires start!"
msgstr "¡Ah! ¡Así comienzan los incendios forestales!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT"
msgid "There go our defenses..."
msgstr "Hasta ahí llegaron nuestras defensas..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC"
msgid "To defend our camp!"
msgstr "¡Para defender nuestro campamento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF"
msgid "It doesn't look like it's working."
msgstr "Parece que no funciona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING"
msgid "Ah!! That's how forest fires start!"
msgstr "¡Ah! ¡Así comienzan los incendios forestales!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Well... I guess Winona'll have to build a new one."
msgstr "Bueno, creo que Winona tendrá que construir una nueva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "You never know what's out there, lurking in the dark."
msgstr "Nunca se sabe lo que hay ahí afuera, acechando en la oscuridad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF"
msgid "Is it out of power?"
msgstr "¿Se le acabó la energía?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "Better bundle up."
msgstr "Será mejor que me abrigue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "We all need to be much more careful with fire."
msgstr "Tenemos que tener más cuidado con el fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess some people like to be more precise than \"hot\" and \"cold\"."
msgstr "Creo que a algunos les gusta algo más específico que solo “frío” o “caliente”."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "It looks like magic!"
msgstr "¡Parece magia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING"
msgid "So close... it smells so good!"
msgstr "Ya casi... ¡Qué bien huele!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING"
msgid "Food is on the way!"
msgstr "¡La comida ya está en camino!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY"
msgid "Come and get it!"
msgstr "¡Vengan a comer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC"
msgid "What a huge oven! We could feed a whole Pioneer troop!"
msgstr "¡Qué horno tan grande! ¡Podrías alimentar a toda una tropa de Pioneros con esto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "Mom made these every year."
msgstr "Mi mamá preparaba estas todos los años."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "I'll make sure the younger kids don't eat too many."
msgstr "Me aseguraré de que los niños más pequeños no coman demasiados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "Don't eat too many, you'll get sick!"
msgstr "¡No coman demasiados! Les caerán mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "I'm... good."
msgstr "Estoy... bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "It's soooo good!"
msgstr "¡Está muy rico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "There's fruit in it, so it's healthy right?"
msgstr "Tiene frutas, así que es saludable, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "Mmm, so warm and cinnamon-y!"
msgstr "Mmm... está caliente y tiene un rico sabor a canela."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "It really warms you up!"
msgstr "¡De verdad te calienta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "It's so sweet!"
msgstr "¡Es tan dulce!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Careful Woby, they're really delicate."
msgstr "Cuidado, Woby. Son muy delicados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "This one should go someplace special."
msgstr "Este debería ir en un sitio especial."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "These ones are my favourite."
msgstr "Estos son mis favoritos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "Looks like... a goat person?"
msgstr "Parece... ¿una persona cabra?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "I wonder what powers it? Oh well!"
msgstr "Me pregunto qué le da energía. ¡Oh, bueno!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Quick, put it out! Put it out!"
msgstr "Rápido, ¡apáguenlo! ¡Apáguenlo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Maybe... we can make another one?"
msgstr "Quizá... podamos hacer otro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE"
msgid "I'm glad I've got you to spend the holiday with, Woby."
msgstr "Me alegra que estés conmigo para pasar las festividades, Woby."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG"
msgid "It'll be fully grown soon."
msgstr "Pronto habrá crecido completamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
msgid "Maybe... we can make another one?"
msgstr "Quizá... podamos hacer otro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC"
msgid "All set up and ready for a tree."
msgstr "Todo está preparado y listo para poner un árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "That's where the Wobsters make camp."
msgstr "Ahí es donde acampan las Languostas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS"
msgid "There's something different about their shell."
msgstr "Sus caparazones tienen algo extraño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER"
msgid "Shellfish are basically bugs of the sea."
msgstr "Los moluscos son básicamente insectos del mar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD"
msgid "Well, at least they'll make a good dinner."
msgstr "Bueno, por lo menos será una buena comida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED"
msgid "Mmm, smells good!"
msgstr "¡Mmm, huele bien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1"
msgid "Good girl, Woby!"
msgstr "¡Buena chica, Woby!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2"
msgid "How could anyone be scared of that face?"
msgstr "¿A quién podría asustarle esa carita?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1"
msgid "Good girl, Woby!"
msgstr "¡Buena chica, Woby!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2"
msgid "What's the matter, girl? Did someone fall down a well?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasó, pequeña? ¿Alguien tuvo una pequeña reducción de tamaño?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER"
msgid "Y-you stay away!"
msgstr "¡Tú... no te acerques!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Mr. %s, wait! The fire pit is over THERE!"
msgstr "Sr. %s, espere, ¡el hoyo de la fogata está por allá!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey Mr. %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, Sr. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST"
msgid "Maybe this will help get over your fear of ghosts! Or not..."
msgstr "Quizás así pueda superar su miedo a los fantasmas... o quizás no..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER"
msgid "There's a murderer in our midst, Woby!"
msgstr "¡Hay un asesino entre nosotros, Woby!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER"
msgid "Mr. %s is just a big softy!"
msgstr "¡El Sr. %s solo es un gran blandengue!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "I don't like the way he's gripping that axe..."
msgstr "No me gusta la forma como aprieta esa hacha..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "The Werebeaver! It's real!"
msgstr "¡El Hombre Castor! ¡Es real!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
msgid "I can see your Canadian spirit! Er... I'll go get a heart."
msgstr "Puedo ver tu espíritu canadiense. Eh... yo iré a buscar un corazón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I thought for sure YOU'D know how to build a campfire!"
msgstr "¡Estaba seguro de que USTED sabía cómo hacer una fogata!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey Mr. %s! How's Ms. Lucy?"
msgstr "¡Hola, Sr. %s! ¿Cómo está la Srta. Lucy?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST"
msgid "Don't worry, you'll have a heart in a jiffy!"
msgstr "No se preocupe, ¡le traeremos un corazón en un abrir y cerrar de ojos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE"
msgid "Mr. %s...? Is that you?"
msgstr "¿Sr. %s, es usted?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST"
msgid "A Pinetree Pioneer is a friend to all woodland creatures! I'll get a heart!"
msgstr "¡Un Pionero Pino es amigo de todas las criaturas del bosque! ¡Le buscaré un corazón!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE"
msgid "There's a Weremoose too?!"
msgstr "¡¿También hay un Hombre Alce?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST"
msgid "Don't worry Mr. %s, Canadians stick together! I'll find you a heart!"
msgstr "No se preocupe, Sr. %s, los canadienses nos apoyamos entre nosotros. ¡Le encontraré un corazón!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER"
msgid "Really Mr. %s? An axe murderer? At least use some imagination."
msgstr "¿En serio, Sr. %s? ¿Un asesino con hacha? Por lo menos tenga algo de imaginación."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
msgid "Us outdoorsy types have each other's backs! Right Mr. %s?"
msgstr "¡Nosotros, a los que nos gusta el aire libre, nos cuidamos entre nosotros! ¿Verdad, Sr. %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT"
msgid "Just a pile of dirt."
msgstr "Solo es una pila de tierra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT"
msgid "What's wrong Woby? It's just a plant!"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa, Woby? ¡Solo es una planta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM"
msgid "Woah! That worm's enormous!"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¡Ese gusano es enorme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It kind of looks like a mouth."
msgstr "Parece una boca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN"
msgid "It IS a mouth!! Come on Woby, let's get a closer look."
msgstr "¡ES una boca! ¡Vamos, Woby! Echemos un vistazo más de cerca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED"
msgid "Is it sick?"
msgstr "¿Está enfermo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT"
msgid "We definitely don't have these back home."
msgstr "Definitivamente no tenemos de estos en mi mundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER"
msgid "More like a glow raisin..."
msgstr "Parece una uva brillante..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT"
msgid "What's wrong Woby? It's just a plant!"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa, Woby? ¡Solo es una planta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER"
msgid "Wait %s! Me... friend! See?"
msgstr "¡Espera, %s! ¡Yo... amigo! ¿Ves?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s! You're going to start a forest fire that way!"
msgstr "¡%s! ¡Si sigues así, iniciarás un incendio forestal!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST"
msgid "Do you need a heart? You know, uh... ba-bum?"
msgstr "¿Necesitas un corazón? Un pum pum, ¿entiendes?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER"
msgid "A killer plant! This would make a great Midnight Broadcast episode..."
msgstr "¡Una planta asesina! Sería material excelente para un episodio del “Programa de Medianoche”."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER"
msgid "You good plant friend! Much thanks!"
msgstr "¡Eres un buen amigo planta! ¡Muchas gracias!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER"
msgid "Is this one of your pranks?"
msgstr "¿Esta es una de tus bromas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Well... I guess he IS an imp..."
msgstr "Bueno... de hecho ES un diablillo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "Does this pose an interesting dilemma for you %s?"
msgstr "¿Esto plantea un dilema interesante para ti, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
msgid "Y-your prank went too far %s!"
msgstr "¡Tu broma se pasó de la raya, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER"
msgid "Hey, thanks for not eating my soul %s! Not that I was worried..."
msgstr "¡Oye, gracias por no comerte mi alma, %s! No es que estuviese preocupado..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER"
msgid "She's just doing what comes naturally, I guess."
msgstr "Imagino que está siguiendo su instinto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "No, first you clear the area, then arrange the logs like this, then-"
msgstr "No. Primero limpias el área, luego arreglas los leños así y luego..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST"
msgid "Oh boy, what trouble did you get into this time, %s?"
msgstr "Oh, vaya. ¿Y ahora en qué problema te metiste, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER"
msgid "Hey %s, no killing people! Killing bad!"
msgstr "¡Oye, %s, nada de matar personas! ¡Matar es malo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks! Uh... florp?"
msgstr "¡Gracias! Eh... ¿flop?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER"
msgid "Is... something wrong with %s?"
msgstr "¿Pasa... algo malo con %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Hey! You'll burn down the camp!"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¡Vas a quemar el campamento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST"
msgid "See, you do have a soul! Now all you need is a heart."
msgstr "¿Ves? ¡Sí tienes alma! Ahora lo único que te falta es un corazón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER"
msgid "You're a killer robot? Amazing! Wait, no Walter, not amazing!"
msgstr "¿Eres un robot asesino? ¡Fantástico! Espera... ¡No, Walter, no es fantástico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER"
msgid "Aw, you do care about us \"meatsacks\"!"
msgstr "¡Ay, “los sacos de carne” sí te importan!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "With this on, I'm invincible! Right?"
msgstr "Con esto soy invencible, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "Is it supposed to feel warm?"
msgstr "¿Es normal que esté tibia?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "Y'ello to you too! Okay, that was bad."
msgstr "Si me lo pongo en el ojo, ¿lanzaré rayos amarillos?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "It never hurts to have a little star power."
msgstr "No hace daño tener un poco de poder estelar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of supplies..."
msgstr "Qué desperdicio de materiales."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I think I need to offer it something for it to work."
msgstr "Creo que tengo que hacer una ofrenda para que funcione."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What should we get, Woby?"
msgstr "¿Qué pedimos, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
msgid "Hey! I was going to use that!"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¡Iba a utilizarlo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC"
msgid "A good sense of direction is important for survival!"
msgstr "¡Tener un buen sentido de la orientación es importante para sobrevivir!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
msgid "You'll never be a Pinetree Pioneer if you can't follow directions!"
msgstr "¡Nunca serás un Pionero Pino si no puedes seguir direcciones!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
msgid "I'd better start training my Carrat."
msgstr "Mejor empiezo a entrenar a mi ratahoria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT"
msgid "I... reacted too slow... to put the fire out..."
msgstr "Reaccioné muy lento... para apagar el fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC"
msgid "By the time we're done, my Carrat will be ready for anything!"
msgstr "Para cuando hayamos terminado, ¡mi ratahoria estará lista para cualquier cosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
msgid "These reflexes could save your life in the wilderness!"
msgstr "¡Tus reflejos te podrían salvar la vida en la selva!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM"
msgid "Maybe I'll put it over here... no, over there!"
msgstr "Quizá podría ponerlo por aquí… ¡no, mejor por allá!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
msgid "Does that look like a fire pit?!"
msgstr "¿Acaso tiene pinta de ser un hoyo para fogatas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "I've never been a coach before!"
msgstr "¡Nunca antes había sido entrenador!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT"
msgid "Hustle, hustle! Coaches say that, right?"
msgstr "¡Muévete, muévete! Los entrenadores dicen eso, ¿eso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
msgid "Do you think we should put it over there, Woby?"
msgstr "¿Crees que deberíamos ponerlo ahí, Woby?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no!!"
msgstr "¡Ay, no!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "This is very serious training equipment."
msgstr "Es un equipo de entrenamiento profesional."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "Aww look at him jump!"
msgstr "¡Ay, miren cómo salta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "I'm great at putting things together!"
msgstr "¡Soy excelente armando cosas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "A good race needs some planning."
msgstr "Una buena carrera requiere algo de planeación."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "Should it go there... no, no, maybe over there..."
msgstr "¿Debería ir ahí? No, no. Quizá por aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Someone sabotaged the race!"
msgstr "¡Alguien saboteó la carrera!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "First one here wins!"
msgstr "¡La primera en llegar, gana!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "Yes!! Good job little guy!"
msgstr "¡Sí! ¡Excelente, pequeña!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "We'll be back for a rematch, {winner}!"
msgstr "¡Pronto vendremos por la revancha, {winner}!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "What if the race just went on forever?"
msgstr "¿Y si la carrera durara para siempre?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "Let's start this race!"
msgstr "¡Comencemos la carrera!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "Woby, help me look for a good place to set this up!"
msgstr "Woby, ayúdame a buscar un buen lugar para colocar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "Why won't everyone just use the fire pit?!"
msgstr "¡¿Por qué nadie usa el hoyo para fogatas?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "He just needs some more training. We'll get there!"
msgstr "Necesita un poco de entrenamiento. ¡Lo conseguiremos con esfuerzo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "Woah, all our training paid off!"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¡Todo nuestro entrenamiento valió la pena!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "Do I get a badge for having the best Carrat?"
msgstr "¿Me dan una medalla por tener la mejor ratahoria?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "I never knew skills could be measured by weight."
msgstr "No tenía idea de que la habilidad pudiese medirse por el peso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Mystery seeds!"
msgstr "¡Semillas misteriosas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "Not knowing what they are is half the fun!"
msgstr "¡No saber qué son es parte de la diversión!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "We'll have his head on a platter!"
msgstr "¡Quiero su cabeza en un plato!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Well, at least the worms are enjoying it."
msgstr "Bueno, por lo menos los gusanos lo están disfrutando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "Who ate all the good parts?"
msgstr "¿Quién se comió las mejores partes?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "That sure is a mystery!"
msgstr "¡Eso sí que es un misterio!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Hurry, stomp it out before it catches fire!"
msgstr "Rápido, ¡písalo antes de que se encienda!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "I sure wish I had a flashlight."
msgstr "Ojalá tuviera una linterna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "If I'm the first one they see, they might think I'm their mom."
msgstr "Si soy el primero al que ven, pensarán que soy su mamá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "Mmmm, tastes like a perfectly toasted s'more."
msgstr "Mmm... sabe como un sándwich perfectamente tostado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "Oh well, we can just try again right? Right...?"
msgstr "Oh, bueno. Podemos intentarlo otra vez, ¿verdad? ¿Verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "Darnit! It's uh... a bit crispy..."
msgstr "¡Rayos! Está un poco... crujiente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "Huh. I thought that would go alright together."
msgstr "¿Ah? Pensé que eso sí combinaría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "Aw, do we really have to leave?"
msgstr "Ay. ¿De verdad tenemos que irnos?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "I'll need a key to get through."
msgstr "Necesito una llave para poder pasar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "I would seriously hurt myself if I did."
msgstr "Me haré mucho daño si hago eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
msgid "That would be wasteful."
msgstr "Eso sería un desperdicio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED"
msgid "No need, it's already en glace."
msgstr "No hace falta. Ya está glaseado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I already have a little companion."
msgstr "Ya tengo un compañerito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "Mon dieu, that's far away."
msgstr "¡Mon dieu! Eso está lejos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "It, oh, it appears to be on fire."
msgstr "Esto, eh, parece que está ardiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess it never occurred to me I'd need to change."
msgstr "Supongo que nunca se me ocurrió que necesitaba cambiar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "I should give them their privacy."
msgstr "Debería darles un poco de privacidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.TOO_SMALL"
msgid "Ah non, this fish is far too small."
msgstr "¡Oh, no! Este pescado es demasiado pequeño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "I'm missing some ingredients."
msgstr "Me faltan algunos ingredientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "Pardonnez-moi! Someone's already doing that."
msgstr "¡Pardonnez-moi! Ya alguien se está encargando de eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "I think I've gotten something mixed up."
msgstr "Creo que me equivoqué mezclando los ingredientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "This isn't the best place for it."
msgstr "Este no es el mejor lugar para construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not quite ready yet."
msgstr "Aún no estoy listo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "Pardonnez-moi! I shouldn't backseat cook."
msgstr "¡Pardonnez-moi! No quise molestar mientras cocinaba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "I'll need to get a little closer to cook with that."
msgstr "Tendré que acercarme un poco más para cocinar con eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "Just a little longer... It's almost done."
msgstr "Solo un poco más. Ya está casi listo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "Oh, excusez-moi."
msgstr "¡Oh! Excusez-moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "Oops, I've left some ingredients inside."
msgstr "Ay, dejé algunos ingredientes dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "What should I draw?"
msgstr "¿Qué debería dibujar?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "Ah non, the fish are too deep for my rod to reach."
msgstr "¡Oh, no! Los peces están en las profundidades y mi caña de pescar no los alcanza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "Apologies, ma petite choux-fleur."
msgstr "Mis disculpas, mi petite coliflor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "Pardonnez-moi, they seem busy right now."
msgstr "Pardonnez-moi. Están ocupados en este momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "It doesn't seem to be working."
msgstr "Parece que no está funcionando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
