msgstr "Ya sabemos eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
