msgstr "Necesita algo más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH"
