msgstr "Ya está hermosamente emplatado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING0
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING0"
