msgstr "Ahora mismo no puedo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE"
