msgstr "Pardonnez-moi, dejaré que termine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTMASTERCHEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTMASTERCHEF"
