#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "That's what you get for being so stinky!"
msgstr "¡Eso te pasa por ser tan asqueroso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "It's true, no one cares."
msgstr "Es verdad, a nadie le importa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "No one would care if this burned down."
msgstr "A nadie le importaría si se quemara."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT"
msgid "I feel a little bad... actually, no I don't."
msgstr "Me da un poco de lástima... No, de hecho, no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks just as flammable as the old ones."
msgstr "Se ve igual de inflamable que las de antes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "Are you supposed to be important or something?"
msgstr "¿Eres importante o algo así?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "Did I do that? It's hard to keep track."
msgstr "¿Eso lo quemé yo? Es difícil llevar la cuenta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "I shouldn't burn it... but I want to..."
msgstr "No debería quemarlo... pero quiero hacerlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "Hahaha-! Uh, I mean, oh no..."
msgstr "¡Ja, ja, ja! Digo, ¡oh, no!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "What's all this stuff for?"
msgstr "¿Para qué sirve todo esto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "I bet that would catch fire reeeal easy."
msgstr "Apuesto a que eso se incendiaría rapidísimo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "Ugh, the SMELL coming from that thing!"
msgstr "Aj. ¡Qué terrible olor despide!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
msgid "What makes that guy so special?"
msgstr "¿Qué lo hace tan especial?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "Hey! It's a bottle of emergency kindling!"
msgstr "¡Oigan! ¡Esta botella sirve como leña de emergencia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "Just a boring old bottle."
msgstr "Solo es una botella vieja y aburrida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "It's not real fire, but it's still pretty fun."
msgstr "No es fuego de verdad, pero aún así es bastante divertido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN"
msgid "Ha! Fire beats water!"
msgstr "¡Ja! ¡El fuego le gana al agua!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "No fun, making me exercise to stay cool!"
msgstr "¡No es divertido tener que cansarme para refrescarme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE"
msgid "I can't WAIT to light it!"
msgstr "¡Me muero por ENCENDERLA!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Haha oh man, who drew THAT?"
msgstr "Ja, ja, ay, ¿quien dibujó ESO?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "Looks kinda bare."
msgstr "Se ve un poco vacío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "It's like a sign, but smaller."
msgstr "Es como una señal, pero más pequeña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "Poor thing. Trapped in this maze."
msgstr "Pobrecito. Atrapado en este laberinto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "I want big horns like that!"
msgstr "¡Quiero cuernos grandes como esos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "I wonder if the rings are an indication of age."
msgstr "Me pregunto si los anillos indican la edad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "Coming up for a peek!"
msgstr "¡Echaré un vistazo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "Out of the ground, into the fire."
msgstr "De la tierra, al fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Hiding from the light, huh?"
msgstr "Escondiéndote de la luz, ¿no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "I'm not sure about this..."
msgstr "No estoy segura acerca de esto..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "It burrows away from the sun's skyfire. Unnatural."
msgstr "Se mete bajo tierra para huir del fuego del sol. Antinatural."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "Joke's on you! I can burn this poo."
msgstr "¡Qué gracioso! Puedo quemar este excremento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "What a wonderfully flammable home."
msgstr "Qué casa tan maravillosamente inflamable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "Noodles, meat and clumps of hair. Nasty."
msgstr "Fideos, carne y mechones de pelo. Repugnante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "Gross. It's full of hairs."
msgstr "Qué asco. Está llena de pelos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "It's dry and smells strange."
msgstr "Está seca y huele raro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE"
msgid "Gross!"
msgstr "¡Asqueroso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "Oh look, a bunch of smashed up rocks!"
msgstr "¡Mira, un montón de rocas aplastadas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's expecting something from me."
msgstr "Espera algo de mí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "Ughh! It's doing the exact opposite of burning!"
msgstr "¡Aghh! ¡Está haciendo exactamente lo contrario a arder!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "Hurry up already, stupid rock!"
msgstr "¡Date prisa, roca estúpida!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "That's obviously completely wrong."
msgstr "Es obvio que esto está mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey, come back here!"
msgstr "¡Oye, vuelve aquí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "Got you now."
msgstr "¡Te atrapé!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "They came off a dead butterfly, gross."
msgstr "Provienen de una mariposa muerta. Qué asco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING"
msgid "Just an un-burned baby tree."
msgstr "Un vástago no quemado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "Doesn't work down here."
msgstr "No funciona aquí abajo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "What the heck? I can still see the moon!"
msgstr "¿Qué demonios? ¡Todavía puedo ver la luna!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "That's as full as it gets."
msgstr "Más llena no puede estar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "A new moon! Great, I hated the old one!"
msgstr "¡Luna nueva! ¡Genial, odiaba la vieja!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The moon's outta here!"
msgstr "¡Salió la luna!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The moon is waxing, unlike me."
msgstr "La luna está creciendo, a diferencia de mí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS"
msgid "What do we need glass for anyway?"
msgstr "¿Y para qué necesitamos vidrio?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE"
msgid "The moon HATES trees."
msgstr "La luna ODIA los árboles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK"
msgid "That's a big chunk of glass!"
msgstr "¡Es un pedazo de vidrio muy grande!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "We should try smoking them out."
msgstr "Deberíamos quemar su madriguera para sacarlas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "Great. A rock with a hole in it."
msgstr "Genial. Una roca con un agujero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "Looks like a jerk."
msgstr "Parece un idiota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "Just another rock to me."
msgstr "Solo otra roca más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "Well I can't burn it."
msgstr "Vaya, no puedo quemarla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "Oh look! ROCKS! Ughhhhh!"
msgstr "¡Oh, mira! ¡ROCAS! ¡Aghhhh!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN"
msgid "I hope it burns."
msgstr "Espero que se queme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Doesn't it feel nice to be back in one piece?"
msgstr "¿No se siente bien estar de nuevo completo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP"
msgid "Almost done, I swear."
msgstr "Ya casi estás listo, lo juro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC"
msgid "Why do I get the feeling we aren't done yet?"
msgstr "¿Por qué tengo la impresión de que no hemos terminado?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN"
msgid "Y'know, this would be a lot easier if you weren't so heavy."
msgstr "Esto sería mucho más fácil si no fueses tan pesada, ¿sabes?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS"
msgid "Yeah, of course I'll lug you over there."
msgstr "Sí, claro que te arrastraré hasta allá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL"
msgid "Okay, let me take you home."
msgstr "Está bien, déjame llevarte a tu casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS"
msgid "Something inside is calling for me."
msgstr "Algo que está adentro me llama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL"
msgid "Something inside is calling for me."
msgstr "Algo que está adentro me llama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "Something inside is calling for me."
msgstr "Algo que está adentro me llama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED"
msgid "Where do you want to go?"
msgstr "¿Dónde quieres que te coloque?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC"
msgid "Ew, I think it's whispering to me."
msgstr "Aj. Creo que me susurra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT"
msgid "Iunno, maybe we can jam stuff in it."
msgstr "No lo sé, quizá podemos taponarla con cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED"
msgid "Ohh, so that's how she keeps those creeps away."
msgstr "¡Oh! Así es como mantiene alejadas a esas alimañas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "HAHA, YES!"
msgstr "¡JA, JA! ¡SÍ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "I don't feel as bad as I thought I would."
msgstr "No me siento tan mal como pensé que me sentiría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It's not gonna grow back."
msgstr "No volverá a crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's so pretty, I might actually feel bad burning it!"
msgstr "¡Es tan bonito que me sentiría mal si lo quemara!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "This would look even prettier if it was on fire."
msgstr "Se vería más bonito si le prendiera fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "What in the world..."
msgstr "Pero qué demonios..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "It's huuuuge!"
msgstr "¡Es enooooorme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "Ugh, it smells like bird butts!"
msgstr "¡Agh, huele a trasero de pájaro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA"
msgid "It looks soooo good!"
msgstr "¡Se ve muy sabrosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "So annoying!"
msgstr "¡Qué molesto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "Keep that mouth away from me!"
msgstr "¡Mantén esa boca lejos de mí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "Blood must bubble in currents muggy and thick."
msgstr "La sangre debe burbujear en corrientes húmedas y espesas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "Its feathers are frazzled."
msgstr "Sus plumas están hechas polvo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "Better it than me."
msgstr "Mejor eso que yo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "It's full of dead stuff, I bet."
msgstr "Está lleno de cosas muertas, seguro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK"
msgid "Ahh, it's like there's a warm fire in my belly."
msgstr "Ah... es como si tuviera un fuego acogedor en mi barriga."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "The vines coil away from my lighter... weird!"
msgstr "Las vides se apartan de mi encendedor... ¡qué raro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "It's made of some kind of jerk rock I can't burn."
msgstr "Está hecho con una especie de roca de pacotilla que no puedo quemar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "It's so useful!"
msgstr "¡Es muy útil!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "She's gonna blow!"
msgstr "¡Va a explotar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "I don't like having my head messed with."
msgstr "No me gusta tener cosas en la cabeza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
