msgstr "Es tan bulbosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Roasting. My favorite cooking method."
msgstr "A las brasas. Mi método favorito de cocina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "No es más que un puñado de semillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "It's glittery and mesmerizing, like a fire!"
msgstr "¡Es brillante y fascinante, como el fuego!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "Gotta hold it with my sleeve so my hands don't get cold."
msgstr "Tengo que sostenerlo con la manga para que no se me enfríen las manos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "It picks up burning materials!"
msgstr "¡Recoge materiales ardiendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "It'll make your fingers tingle."
msgstr "Te hace cosquillas en los dedos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "It's a rock. Ugh!"
msgstr "Es una roca. ¡Agh!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "It gives me a headache."
msgstr "Me da dolor de cabeza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "Kind of tacky."
msgstr "Un poco vulgar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE"
msgid "Am I just hungry, or does everything look extra tasty?"
msgstr "¿Tengo hambre o es que todo se ve muy delicioso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "Music is boring."
msgstr "La música es aburrida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "I bet it'd burn!"
msgstr "¡Apuesto a que se puede quemar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA"
msgid "It's so delicate looking, I just want to smush it."
msgstr "Se ve tan delicado que me dan ganas de aplastarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "It's got a weaponized butt!"
msgstr "¡Tiene un trasero armado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "Run away, tiny dancers."
msgstr "Corran, pequeños bailarines."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER"
msgid "Good. These are the hot ones."
msgstr "Bien. Estos son los que pican."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER"
msgid "My mouth is on fire!"
msgstr "¡Mi boca se quema!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED"
msgid "First rule of vegetables: fire makes it better."
msgstr "Primera regla de las verduras: el fuego las hace más apetitosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "No es más que un puñado de semillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "Evil bird! Get away from those yummy berries!"
msgstr "¡Pájaro malvado! ¡Aléjate de esas deliciosas bayas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It's a big ol' fan."
msgstr "Es un abanico antiguo y grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Well, that's burned now."
msgstr "Bueno, ya se quemó."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What do we have to do now?"
msgstr "¿Qué tenemos que hacer ahora?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't even like gobblers!"
msgstr "¡Ni siquiera me gustan los pavos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "Tasty things, sealed with fire."
msgstr "Cosas deliciosas selladas con fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "Stupid flowers. They're almost useless."
msgstr "Flores estúpidas. Son casi inútiles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Ew, they're sticky."
msgstr "Agh, están pegajosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "How am I supposed to burn it now?"
msgstr "¿Cómo se supone que debo quemarlo ahora?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "Gross! Let's burn it."
msgstr "¡Qué asco! Quemémosla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "It's very pointy."
msgstr "Es muy puntiagudo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING"
msgid "How does it smell so good?"
msgstr "¿Por qué huele tan bien?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "All washed up."
msgstr "Está hasta el cuello."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "You, I like."
msgstr "Me agradas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "Eat dirt!"
msgstr "¡Come tierra!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Sure does like using those signs."
msgstr "Seguro que le gusta usar esos tatuajes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1"
msgid "All washed up."
msgstr "Está hasta el cuello."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2"
msgid "You, I like."
msgstr "Me agradas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3"
msgid "Eat dirt!"
msgstr "¡Come tierra!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4"
msgid "Sure does like using those signs."
msgstr "Seguro que le gusta usar esos tatuajes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "I like his attitude!"
msgstr "¡Me gusta su actitud!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "It's a backpack made out of butts!"
msgstr "¡Es una mochila hecha de traseros!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "It can always get worse, I guess."
msgstr "Siempre puede ser peor, supongo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess I have it alright."
msgstr "Supongo que ya la tengo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Nice redecorating job!"
msgstr "¡Buen trabajo de redecoración!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "He's doing pig things in there."
msgstr "Está haciendo cosas de cerdos ahí adentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "These pigs have questionable taste in architecture."
msgstr "Estos cerdos tienen un dudoso gusto en arquitectura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "You jerk! Let me in!"
msgstr "¡Idiota! ¡Déjame entrar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "Blech. What a slob."
msgstr "Qué patán."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "I wonder how they taste."
msgstr "Me pregunto a qué saben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Ick. It's following me."
msgstr "¡Puaj! Está siguiéndome."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Ugh. They're fragrant."
msgstr "¡Uf! Qué mal huelen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "He's not the boss of me!"
msgstr "¡No es mi jefe!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "Bring it on, piggie!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, cerdito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt. I like it."
msgstr "Quemado. Me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Needs meat."
msgstr "Necesita carne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Where's the shrine to me?"
msgstr "¿Dónde está el santuario para mí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "Ha ha. A pig's butt."
msgstr "¡Ja, ja! El trasero de un cerdo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "It smells terrible!"
msgstr "¡Huele fatal!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "These pigs sure know how to have a good time."
msgstr "Estos cerdos saben cómo pasar un buen rato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN"
msgid "Finally, someone to do my dirty work."
msgstr "Por fin, alguien que haga mi trabajo sucio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "I'd burn it, but it might be worth something."
msgstr "Lo quemaría, pero podría valer algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "Hey there, tree seed."
msgstr "Hola, semilla de árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "You'll be a real tree soon."
msgstr "Muy pronto serás un árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "Three times the pointiness."
msgstr "Tres veces puntiagudo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "Eww, it's all slimy."
msgstr "Qué asco, está toda viscosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Fire makes everything better."
msgstr "El fuego lo mejora todo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd eat it if I had to."
msgstr "Me la comería si tuviera que hacerlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "Hurry up, you stupid plant!"
msgstr "¡Date prisa, planta estúpida!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "Oh boy. Vegetables."
msgstr "Ah. Verduras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It's crackly and dry. Good kindling!"
msgstr "Es seco y crepitante. ¡Buena leña!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Why, %s... that fire in your eyes!"
msgstr "¡¿Por qué, %s... tienes ese fuego en los ojos?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "BUUURN!"
msgstr "¡ARDEEE!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "¡Hola, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "I better get a heart for %s."
msgstr "Será mejor que consiga un corazón para %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Burn the murderer!"
msgstr "¡Quemen al asesino!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "Who do ghosts call? %s!"
msgstr "¿A quién llaman los fantasmas? ¡%s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE"
msgid "Hey, now I can weigh my fish... not that I care."
msgstr "Oigan, ahora puedo pesar mis pescados. No es que me importe mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE"
msgid "Yup, I'll be having ten more of those."
msgstr "Sí, quiero diez más de esas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "Is it supposed to have this many parts?"
msgstr "¿Se supone que esto tiene muchas partes?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "Fire always makes things better."
msgstr "El fuego siempre mejora las cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like the part from inside the fruit."
msgstr "Parece como la parte de dentro de la fruta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "This pond will definitely not ignite. How dull."
msgstr "Este estanque sin duda no es inflamable. Qué aburrido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL"
msgid "I don't like the look it's giving me!"
msgstr "¡No me gusta cómo me está mirando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH"
msgid "Slippery fishy!"
msgstr "¡Pescado resbaladizo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "It must need a lot of water."
msgstr "Debe de necesitar mucha agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "Ew. Nasty. But useful."
msgstr "¡Puaj! Repugnante. Pero útil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM"
msgid "Shakes things up a bit."
msgstr "Para sacudir un poco las cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "Ughhh, this is taking forever!"
msgstr "Aj. Esto se está tardando demasiado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "Come on fire, do your thing!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, fuego, haz tu trabajo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "Good. Let's eat!"
msgstr "Bien. ¡Comamos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY"
msgid "Stupid empty pot."
msgstr "Estúpida olla vacía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Just a dumb pot."
msgstr "Es solo una tonta olla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "All that work for just a little bit of spice?"
msgstr "¿Todo ese trabajo por un poquito de sazón?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "All that work better be worth it."
msgstr "Espero que todo ese esfuerzo valga la pena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT"
msgid "I call dibs on the tent!"
msgstr "¡La tienda es mía!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM"
msgid "I was never any good at setting these things up."
msgstr "Nunca fui buena armando este tipo de cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATO"
msgid "We grew it in that gross muck."
msgstr "Lo plantamos en ese estiércol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE"
msgid "MY stuff never comes out looking like THIS!"
msgstr "¡MIS platos nunca salen ASÍ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO"
msgid "Woah, I didn't know potatoes came in that shape!"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¡No sabía que había papas con esa forma!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking just means sticking stuff in fire."
msgstr "Cocinar es tan solo meter cosas en el fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "No es más que un puñado de semillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "I'd rather burn them."
msgstr "Preferiría quemarlos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "I wonder if it is flammable."
msgstr "Me pregunto si es inflamable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC"
msgid "A bird! I wonder if it's tasty."
msgstr "¡Un ave! Me pregunto si es sabrosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD"
msgid "Haha, I got you."
msgstr "Ja, ja. Te tengo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "I bet I could sneak up on it now."
msgstr "Estoy segura de que podría acercármele sigilosamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "I wonder what would happen if I applied fire."
msgstr "Me pregunto qué pasará si le prendo fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "Cookies!!!"
msgstr "¡¡¡Galletas!!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE"
msgid "Yep, I'm eating this whole thing."
msgstr "Sí, me lo comeré todo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Fire on the outside turned out pretty well."
msgstr "El fuego en el exterior resultó bastante bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "Fire on the inside is amazing!"
msgstr "¡El fuego en el interior es increíble!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "Seeds for fire's best vegetable-friend... the pumpkin."
msgstr "Unas semillas del mejor amigo vegetal del fuego... la calabaza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "Has science gone too far?"
msgstr "¿La ciencia fue demasiado lejos?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "Weird!"
msgstr "¡Qué rara!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "Some sort of weird rock."
msgstr "Es algún tipo de roca extraña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "I wonder where all the food goes. Probably somewhere gross."
msgstr "Me pregunto a dónde va toda la comida. Es probable que a algún lugar asqueroso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't. Look. Up."
msgstr "No. Mires. Arriba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
msgid "Boring."
msgstr "Qué aburrido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
msgid "Yawn."
msgstr "Aburrido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
msgid "What's so great about her?"
msgstr "¿Qué tiene de espectacular?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
msgid "Haha! Look at this dumb goat statue."
msgstr "¡Ja, ja! Mira esa tonta estatua de cabra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
msgid "Ew. It's ugly."
msgstr "Agh, qué fea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO"
msgid "Haha. You're old."
msgstr "¡Ja, ja! Eres viejo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "But I want more berries!"
msgstr "¡Pero quiero más bayas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER"
msgid "Now I don't have to use my hands."
msgstr "Ahora no tengo que usar las manos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "No es más que un puñado de semillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
msgid "Fancy."
msgstr "Elegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL"
msgid "It's kinda small."
msgstr "Es un poco pequeña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1"
msgid "Wow. A coin. Pfft."
msgstr "¡Vaya! Una moneda. Pfff."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2"
msgid "I can probably buy something good with this."
msgstr "Quizá pueda comprar algo bueno con esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3"
msgid "I'm rich!"
msgstr "¡Tengo una fortuna!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4"
msgid "Guess that thing liked what we gave it."
msgstr "Supongo que le gustó lo que le dimos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT"
msgid "Needs more fire."
msgstr "Necesita más fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "I bet it's tasty."
msgstr "Apuesto a que es sabroso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP"
msgid "That'll show those crabs."
msgstr "Eso le dará una lección a esos cangrejos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN"
msgid "I can take my pick of them."
msgstr "Puedo recogerlos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR"
msgid "Can you just eat flour?"
msgstr "¿Solo puedes comer harina?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED"
msgid "Leaf this to a professional."
msgstr "Que un profesional lo hojee."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe that thing up there'll eat it."
msgstr "Tal vez esa cosa de ahí se lo coma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH"
msgid "This should shut that thing up for a while."
msgstr "Esto debería callar a esa cosa por un rato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK"
msgid "This won't shut it up for long."
msgstr "Esto no la callará por mucho tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH"
msgid "It doesn't want that. Might as well burn it."
msgstr "No lo quiere. Podríamos quemarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT"
msgid "Looks good to me."
msgstr "Me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC"
msgid "It's just a couple cloves of garlic."
msgstr "Son solo unos dientes de ajo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Fire made it better."
msgstr "El fuego lo mejoró un poco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "No es más que un puñado de semillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID"
msgid "He'll eat just about anything."
msgstr "Come cualquier cosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK"
msgid "What? We needed milk."
msgstr "¿Qué? Necesitamos leche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM"
msgid "Her eyes creep me out."
msgstr "Sus ojos me dan escalofríos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL"
msgid "Fire it up!"
msgstr "¡Enciéndelo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM"
msgid "Ugh, I guess I should set it up."
msgstr "Agh, supongo que debería prepararlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL"
msgid "If it was bigger I could use more fire."
msgstr "Si fuese más grande, le haría falta más fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM"
msgid "I should set it up over the firepit."
msgstr "Debería colocarlo encima del fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE"
msgid "You mean I gotta do work?"
msgstr "¿Quieres decir que tengo que trabajar?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY"
msgid "I'll use this if I can't burn it open."
msgstr "Usaré esto si no puedo abrirla con fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK"
msgid "There's more stuff to burn in the park."
msgstr "Quedan más cosas que quemar en el parque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST"
msgid "Just an old lamp post."
msgstr "No es más que un farol viejo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT"
msgid "Whatever. It's a lamp."
msgstr "Es una lámpara. Qué va."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE"
msgid "I can smash stuff down with it."
msgstr "Puedo aplastar cosas con esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE"
msgid "That's what passes for a village around here, I guess."
msgstr "Así son las aldeas por aquí, supongo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1"
msgid "There's a lot of stuff to burn in there."
msgstr "Hay un montón de cosas que quemar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2"
msgid "I'd burn it, but I need the things in there."
msgstr "Lo quemaría, pero necesito las cosas que tiene."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS"
msgid "It's totally raw. Fire could fix that!"
msgstr "Está todo crudo. ¡El fuego lo puede arreglar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC"
msgid "They're so hideous they're almost cute."
msgstr "Son tan horribles que son hasta tiernos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED"
msgid "Hey! Give me more mushrooms!"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¡Dame más hongos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION"
msgid "It's so bulbous."
msgstr "Es tan bulbosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Roasting. My favorite cooking method."
msgstr "A las brasas. Mi método favorito de cocina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "No es más que un puñado de semillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN"
msgid "Now we're cooking."
msgstr "Esto sí que es cocinar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM"
msgid "I can't wait to use it!"
msgstr "¡Qué ganas que tengo de usarlo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE"
msgid "That looks sharp."
msgstr "Parece puntiagudo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL"
msgid "Gross."
msgstr "Qué asqueroso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2"
msgid "Ugly."
msgstr "Qué feo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN"
msgid "A fountain with no water. Maybe that's a metaphor?"
msgstr "Una fuente sin agua. ¿Tal vez sea una metáfora?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC"
msgid "Didn't even have to melt the locks."
msgstr "Ni siquiera tuve que quemar el candado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED"
msgid "I can't even burn it open!"
msgstr "¡Ni siquiera puedo abrirla con fuego!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK"
msgid "It's stone. I can't burn it."
msgstr "Es una piedra. No puedo quemarla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN"
msgid "Cremation is the only way to do it."
msgstr "La incineración es la única forma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB"
msgid "Don't worry, I won't kick you."
msgstr "No te preocupes, no te daré una patada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead."
msgstr "Está muerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC"
msgid "I haven't got any crumbs for you."
msgstr "No tengo migas para ti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's taking a nap."
msgstr "Está tomando una siesta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER"
msgid "Ohh. Look who's fancy now!"
msgstr "Ah. ¡Mira quién es elegante ahora!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT"
msgid "Blech! Tastes like ocean."
msgstr "¡Puaj! Sabe a océano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL"
msgid "I'm just gonna keep jumping through portals til I figure out a way home."
msgstr "Voy a seguir viajando a través de los portales hasta que encuentre un camino a casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY"
msgid "Fancy key."
msgstr "Una llave bonita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT"
msgid "I should light a fire under its butt."
msgstr "Debería encender un fuego debajo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO"
msgid "We grew it in that gross muck."
msgstr "Lo plantamos en ese estiércol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking just means sticking stuff in fire."
msgstr "Cocinar es tan solo meter cosas en el fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "No es más que un puñado de semillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER"
msgid "I set it up. Now what?"
msgstr "Ya la coloqué. ¿Y ahora qué?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM"
msgid "It needs to be set up in a firepit."
msgstr "Hay que colocarlo encima del fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL"
msgid "It goes with the fire."
msgstr "Va con el fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP"
msgid "Sweet stuff goes in there."
msgstr "Aquí hay algo dulce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP"
msgid "That one stayed in the ground too long."
msgstr "Estuvo demasiado tiempo en el suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE"
