#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN"
