#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
