#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
