#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
