#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
