#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
