#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firesuppressor_circus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firesuppressor_circus"
msgid "Look and be amazed by the incredible automatic snowball juggling machine!"
msgstr "¡Contempla y asómbrate con la increíble máquina de malabares de bolas de nieve automática!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firesuppressor_robot
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firesuppressor_robot"
msgid "Fires never had a chance."
msgstr "Los incendios nunca tuvieron oportunidad."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_crown
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_crown"
msgid "This feather hat is so luxurious to the touch!"
msgstr "¡Este sombrero de plumas es un lujo que se aprecia incluso desde lejos!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_healing
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_healing"
msgid "This lovely wreath of Life Blossoms have lost their magic, but they still look divine."
msgstr "Esta corona de flores de la vida perdió su magia, pero sigue estando igual de bonita."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_holly_wreath
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_holly_wreath"
msgid "A jolly holly laurel to wear on your head. How winter-y!"
msgstr "Un laurel navideño para llevarlo en la cabeza. ¡Tan invernal!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_ribbon_wreath
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_ribbon_wreath"
msgid "Get in the seasonal spirit by wreathing your head in lovely ribbons!"
msgstr "¡Empápate del espíritu festivo poniéndote unas bonitas cintas en la cabeza!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_wreath
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_wreath"
msgid "Laurels ought rest on you, not the other way around."
msgstr "No te duermas en los laureles, úsalos en la cabeza."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_combathelm
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_combathelm"
msgid "Who wouldn't be intimidated by this fearsome helm?"
msgstr "¿Quién no se sentiría intimidado por este yelmo?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_combathelm2
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_combathelm2"
msgid "Behold its terrifying curly horns!"
msgstr "¡Contempla sus aterradores cuernos enroscados!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_hockey
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_hockey"
msgid "I'm gonna score a hat trick!"
msgstr "¡Con este sombrero anotaré un triplete!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_beardeddragon
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_beardeddragon"
msgid "A pet as noble as he is huggable."
msgstr "Un animal tan noble como abrazable."

