#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.lantern_crystal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.lantern_crystal"
msgid "It radiates a warm, soothing glow."
msgstr "Irradia un resplandor cálido y reconfortante."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.lantern_tesla
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.lantern_tesla"
msgid "An electrical resonant transformer circuit that provides light."
msgstr "Un circuito transformador eléctrico que proporciona luz."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.lantern_winter
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.lantern_winter"
msgid "A lovely stained glass lantern to illuminate your winter nights."
msgstr "Una hermosa linterna de vidriera para iluminar tus noches de invierno."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_blue_cornflower
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_blue_cornflower"
msgid "These 'rubber glove blue' colored pants are perfect for playing checkers, or checking items off your to-do list."
msgstr "Estos pantalones de color “azul guante de goma” son perfectos para jugar a las damas, o para ir con alguna dama a cenar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_green_laurel
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_green_laurel"
msgid "These 'willful green' colored pants are perfect for playing checkers, or checking items off your to-do list."
msgstr "Estos pantalones de color “verde obstinado” son perfectos para jugar a las damas, o para ir con alguna dama a cenar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_grey_slate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_grey_slate"
msgid "These 'rainy gray' colored pants are perfect for playing checkers, or checking items off your to-do list."
msgstr "Estos pantalones de color “gris lluvioso” son perfectos para jugar a las damas, o para ir con alguna dama a cenar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_orange_lumberjack
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_orange_lumberjack"
msgid "These 'lumberjack orange' colored pants are perfect for playing checkers, or checking items off your to-do list."
msgstr "Estos pantalones de color “naranja leñador” son perfectos para jugar a las damas, o para ir con alguna dama a cenar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_tan_grass
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_checkered_pleats_tan_grass"
msgid "These 'dry grass tan' colored pants are perfect for playing checkers, or checking items off your to-do list."
msgstr "Estos pantalones de color “moreno hierba seca” son perfectos para jugar a las damas, o para ir con alguna dama a cenar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_jeans_black_scribble
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_jeans_black_scribble"
msgid "Hard-wearing cotton dungarees, in a 'scribble black' color."
msgstr "Un overol de algodón resistente de color “negro garabato”."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_jeans_blue_peacock
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_jeans_blue_peacock"
msgid "Hard-wearing cotton dungarees, in a 'bird tail blue' color."
msgstr "Un overol de algodón resistente de color “azul cola de pájaro”."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_jeans_grey_silver
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_jeans_grey_silver"
msgid "Hard-wearing cotton dungarees, in a 'cumulus gray' color."
msgstr "Un overol de algodón resistente de color “gris cúmulo”."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_jeans_navy_ocean
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_jeans_navy_ocean"
msgid "Hard-wearing cotton dungarees, in an 'unsuitably blue' color."
msgstr "Un overol de algodón resistente de color “azul inadecuado”."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_pants_basic_black_scribble
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_pants_basic_black_scribble"
msgid "Wearing these 'scribble black' colored pants won't help you survive... But you'll look great!"
msgstr "Llevar estos pantalones de color “negro garabato” no te ayudará a sobrevivir... ¡Pero te verás genial!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_pants_basic_blue_sky
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_pants_basic_blue_sky"
msgid "Wearing these 'schematic blue' colored pants won't help you survive... But you'll look great!"
msgstr "Llevar estos pantalones de color “azul esquemático” no te ayudará a sobrevivir... ¡Pero te verás genial!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_pants_basic_brown_sepia
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.legs_pants_basic_brown_sepia"
msgid "Wearing these 'werebeaver brown' colored pants won't help you survive... But you'll look great!"
